RADAR_LOAD("2024-02",[{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.4743770","t":"Kinetic Study of Initial Surface Reaction in Atomic Layer Deposition of Gallium Nitride Using Trimethylgallium and Ammonia: Density Functional Theory Calculation","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.4743770","s":"SSRN","d":"2024-02-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Tanabat Promjun","P. Pungboon Pansila"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"使用三甲基镓和氨进行氮化镓原子层沉积的初始表面反应动力学研究：密度泛函理论计算","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1116/6.0003352","t":"High enhancement, low cost, large area surface enhanced Raman scattering substrates all by atomic layer deposition on porous filter paper","u":"https://doi.org/10.1116/6.0003352","s":"Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology A","d":"2024-02-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"We successfully developed an atomic layer deposition (ALD) method for making Ag noble nanoparticles on cheap, commercial filter paper consisting of three-dimensional porous glass fibers and investigated the evolution of Ag nanostructures with some key process parameters. By tuning Ag particle sizes and controlling the cycle numbers of ALD deposited Ag films, we were able to obtain high-density isolated Ag nanoparticles with average sizes in 3–9 nm without the formation of agglomerates and continuous Ag films. We proved the presence of strong localized surface plasmon resonance peaks near a target wavelength of 632 nm. We further proved the presence of surface enhanced Raman scattering (SERS) signals on the Ag coated filter paper substrates using pyridine as the test analyte. Our results demonstrate that ALD is a very promising technique for a rational design of SERS substrates and, thus,","au":["Feng Niu","Yimin Hu","Stephen LeKarz","Wei Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"在多孔滤纸上通过原子层沉积制备高增强、低成本、大面积表面增强拉曼散射基底","zb":"通过原子层沉积 (ALD) 方法在廉价商用滤纸上制备 Ag 贵金属纳米颗粒，研究了 Ag 纳米结构的演变与关键工艺参数的关系。通过调节 Ag 颗粒尺寸和控制 ALD 沉积 Ag 薄膜的循环次数，获得了平均尺寸为 3–9 nm 的高密度孤立 Ag 纳米颗粒，无团聚和连续 Ag 薄膜的形成。证明了在目标波长 632 nm 附近存在强烈的局域表面等离子体共振峰。进一步使用吡啶作为分析物，证明了 Ag 涂覆滤纸基底上存在表面增强拉曼散射 (SERS) 信号。结果表明，ALD 是一种非常有前景的技术，用于合理设计 SERS 基底，因此对于未来商业应用的大面积、低成本 SERS 基底的制造具有巨大潜力。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1039/d3lf00271c","t":"Characterizing Catalyst Function and Transformations in the Plasma Reduction of CO 2 on Atomic Layer Deposition-Synthesized Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d3lf00271c","s":"RSC Applied Interfaces","d":"2024-02-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The enhancement of CO2 reduction in atmospheric-pressure, non-thermal plasma has been shown using a variety of catalyst systems with ranging composition, particle sizes, and morphologies. Improvements in CO2 conversion can be attained by choice of catalyst material. However, inhomogeneity in the material distribution arising from the synthesis affects the catalytically active surface area and dielectric environment that modulates the plasma properties near the catalyst. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) can be used to control the composition of ultra- thin layers on support materials. We used ALD to synthesize metal oxide catalyst coatings on high surface area supports. We found that TiO 2 achieved significantly higher yields of CO2 conversion (to CO and O2 ) at low reactor power compared to ZnO or Al2O3 , materials commonly used a support for other catalysts. We also observed an unexpected ","au":["Samuel K. Conlin","Hamed Mehrabi","David N. Parette","Eva M. Nichols","Robert H. Coridan"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"表征原子层沉积合成催化剂上 CO2 等离子体还原中的催化剂功能和转化","zb":"大气压非热等离子体中 CO2 还原的增强已使用各种催化剂体系得到证实，这些体系的组成、颗粒大小和形貌各不相同。通过选择催化剂材料可以提高 CO2 转化率。然而，由于合成而产生的材料分布不均匀会影响催化活性表面积和介电环境，该环境调节催化剂附近等离子体特性。原子层沉积 (ALD) 可用于在载体材料上控制超薄层的成分。我们使用 ALD 在高表面积载体上合成金属氧化物催化剂涂层。我们发现 TiO2 在比通常用作其他催化剂载体的 ZnO 或 Al2O3 更低的反应器功率下实现了显着更高的 CO2 转化率（转化为 CO 和 O2）。我们还观察到 ZnO 的催化活性随着功率的增加而意外增加。这些结果表明 ALD 可以明确地隔离材料在等离子体反应器中的催化效应。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积","pp":"ChemRxiv"},{"id":"10.1002/admi.202301064","t":"Optimizing Atomic Layer Deposition Processes with Nanowire‐Assisted TEM Analysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/admi.202301064","s":"Advanced Materials Interfaces","d":"2024-02-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Atomic layer deposition (ALD) is one of the premier methods to synthesize ultra‐thin materials on complex surfaces. The technique allows for precise control of the thickness down to single atomic layers, while at the same time providing uniform coverage even for structures with extreme aspect ratios such as deep trenches or wires. While many materials can be readily deposited using ALD there is still a lot of research going on to make other materials more accessible. When establishing a new process or adapting an existing process to a new reactor, precise optimization of the deposition parameters is necessary. However, characterizing the parameters of deposition rate, uniformity, composition, and structure is a challenging and time‐consuming task. Here a method is presented to optimize these process parameters during ALD deposition using high‐aspect ratio nanowires and transmiss","au":["Peter Schweizer","Lilian M. Vogl","Xavier Maeder","Ivo Utke","Johann Michler"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"利用纳米线辅助的 TEM 分析优化原子层沉积过程","zb":"原子层沉积 (ALD) 是在复杂表面上合成超薄材料的一种主要方法。该技术允许精确控制厚度，达到单原子层，同时在具有极端纵横比的结构（如深沟槽或线）上提供均匀的覆盖。虽然许多材料可以使用 ALD 直接沉积，但仍有大量研究致力于使其他材料更容易沉积。在建立新工艺或将现有工艺适应于新反应器时，必须精确优化沉积参数。然而，表征沉积速率、均匀性、成分和结构的参数是一项具有挑战性和耗时的工作。这里提出了一种方法，利用高纵横比纳米线和透射电子显微镜 (TEM) 在 ALD 沉积过程中优化这些工艺参数。纳米线样品直接制备在放入 ALD 反应器中的 TEM 网格上。在几分钟内，涂覆的纳米线可以通过 TEM 分析以获得层的厚度、化学成分、结晶度和涂层的均匀性。这允许高测试通量，并随后快速优化沉积参数。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202401094","t":"Frustrated Lewis Pairs on Zr Single Atoms Supported N‐Doped TiO 2‐x Catalysts for Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction To Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202401094","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2024-02-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical reduction of nitrates (NO 3 RR) for ammonia synthesis at room temperature holds immense potential. One key challenge is the adsorption and activation of NO 3 − , along with the provision of sufficient active hydrogen to accelerate the hydrogenation process. Here, the study prepares N‐doped TiO 2‐x supported by Zr single atoms (Zr‐TiON) with rich oxygen vacancies (O v ), in which unsaturated Zr (Lewis acidic, LA) sites together with oxygen atoms around O v (Lewis base, LB) form frustrated Lewis acid‐base pairs (FLPs). At −60 mA cm −2 , NH 3 Faradaic efficiency reaches 94.8%, corresponding to the production rate of 663.15 µmol h −1 mg cat −1 . The yield rate is up to 26.16 mmol h −1 mg cat −1 at −1 A cm −2 in flowing electrolyzer. Theoretical calculations and in situ spectroscopy analysis reveal that the interaction between LA and LB sites in FLPs plays a cruci","au":["Lekuan Yang","Chaochen Wang","Yufeng Li","Wangxin Ge","Lei Tang","Jianhua Shen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Zr单原子负载N掺杂TiO2-x催化剂上的摩擦路易斯对用于电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"硝酸盐（NO3RR）的电化学还原在室温下具有巨大的潜力。一个关键挑战是硝酸盐根（NO3 −）的吸附和活化，以及提供足够的活性氢来加速加氢过程。在此，研究了制备了富氧空位（O v）的 N 掺杂 TiO 2−x 负载 Zr 单原子（Zr-TiON），其中不饱和 Zr（路易斯酸性，LA）位点与氧空位周围的氧原子（路易斯碱性，LB）形成摩擦路易斯酸碱对（FLPs）。在 −60 mA cm −2 时，NH 3 法拉第效率达到 94.8%，对应于 663.15 µmol h −1 mg cat −1 的产率。在流动电解槽中，在 −1 A cm −2 时，产率高达 26.16 mmol h −1 mg cat −1。理论计算和原位光谱分析表明，FLPs 中 LA 和 LB 位点之间的相互作用在促进富电子 NO 3 − 和缺电子 * H 的吸附和活化方面起着关键作用。增强的 FLPs 显着降低了 H 2 ","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s10705-024-10345-w","t":"Biological nitrogen fixation in young and old tropical forests under five contrasting edaphoclimatic conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10705-024-10345-w","s":"Nutrient Cycling in Agroecosystems","d":"2024-02-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Young tropical forests have higher relative plant densities of potentially nodulating Leguminosae species than old forests, but comparisons of their proportions of effective N-fixing plants and amounts of fixed N are scarce. We determined leaf N stocks derived from symbiotic biological N fixation in woody legumes of young and old forests under the following five edaphoclimatic conditions, in Northeastern Brazil: (1) humid lowland coastal; (2) humid montane; (3) subhumid high fertility soil; (4) semiarid high fertility soil; and (5) semiarid montane low fertility soil. N amounts derived from fixation and stocked in the leaves were estimated using the ¹⁵N natural abundance technique. Fixed N stocks in the leaves were low in both young and old forests of the nutrient-poor semiarid montane forests (< 0.3 kg ha⁻¹) due to the low relative densities of nodulating legume plants (15 and 10 pl ha⁻","au":["Tânia L. Costa","Everardo V. S. B. Sampaio","Ana D. S. Freitas","Elcida L. Araújo","Plínio B. Camargo","Raquel M. B. Sampaio"],"o":"回填","zt":"在五种不同的土壤气候条件下年轻和古老的热带森林中的生物固氮","zb":"年轻热带森林比古老森林具有更高的潜在固氮豆科植物相对植物密度，但对其有效固氮植物的比例和固定氮的数量的比较很少。我们在巴西东北部的以下五种土壤气候条件下，确定了木本豆科植物中来自共生生物固氮的叶绿素氮储量：（1）湿润低地沿海；（2）湿润山地；（3）亚湿润高肥力土壤；（4）半干旱高肥力土壤；（5）半干旱山地低肥力土壤。使用 ¹⁵N 自然丰度技术估计了来自固氮和储存在叶中的氮量。在营养贫乏的半干旱山地森林中，年轻和古老森林的叶片中固定的氮储量都很低（< 0.3 kg ha⁻¹），因为固氮豆科植物的相对密度较低（15 和 10 pl ha⁻¹，分别），尽管固氮物种的个体大多在固氮。在其他四个地点，年轻森林（148 至 635）的固氮物种相对密度高于古老森林（42 至 327 pl ha⁻¹），有效固氮植物的密度（96 至 265 对 9 至 140 pl ha⁻¹）也是如此。叶片氮储量在年轻森林","ob":"生物固氮（非气相热催化）"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.3c05989","t":"Catalytic Reaction Triggered by Magnetic Induction Heating Mechanistically Distinguishes Itself from the Standard Thermal Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.3c05989","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2024-02-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"As a recent advancement in reaction engineering, magnetic induction heating (MIH) is utilized to initiate the intended reactions by enabling the self-heating of the ferromagnetic catalyst particles. While MIH can be energy-efficient and industrially scalable, its full potential has been underappreciated in catalysis because of the perception that MIH is merely an alternative heating approach. Unexpectedly, we show that the MIH-triggered reaction could go beyond standard thermal catalysis. Specifically, by probing the representative Pt/Fe 3 O 4 catalysts with CO oxidation in both thermal and MIH modes with consistent temperature profiles and catalyst structures, we found that the MIH mode boosts the reactivity more than 25 times by modifying Pt–FeO x interfacial synergies and promoting facile oxidation of the adsorbed carbonyl species by atomic oxygen. As we preliminarily observed, this b","au":["Alexander Adogwa","Ewa Chukwu","Alexander Malaj","Venkata R. Punyapu","Owen Chamness","Nicolas Glisson"],"o":"回填","why":["Induction Heating"],"zt":"磁感应加热触发的催化反应在机理上区别于标准热反应","zb":"利用 Pt/Fe3O4 催化剂在热模式和磁感应加热模式下进行 CO 氧化对比。发现磁感应加热模式通过改变 Pt–FeOx 界面协同效应并促进吸附羰基物种的原子氧氧化，使反应活性提高了 25 倍以上。","ob":"其他催化反应","top":1},{"id":"10.1158/0008-5472.can-23-0673","t":"β-Catenin Activation Reprograms Ammonia Metabolism to Promote Senescence Resistance in Hepatocellular Carcinoma","u":"https://doi.org/10.1158/0008-5472.can-23-0673","s":"Cancer Research","d":"2024-02-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC) is a typical tumor that undergoes metabolic reprogramming, differing from normal liver tissue in glucose, lipid, nucleic acid, and amino acid metabolism. Although ammonia is a toxic metabolic by-product, it has also been recently recognized as a signaling molecule to activate lipid metabolism, and it can be a nitrogen source for biosynthesis to support tumorigenesis. In this study, we revealed that β-catenin activation increases ammonia production in HCC mainly by stimulating glutaminolysis. β-Catenin/LEF1 activated the transcription of the glutamate dehydrogenase GLUD1, which then promoted ammonia utilization to enhance the production of glutamate, aspartate, and proline as evidenced by 15NH4Cl metabolic flux. β-Catenin/TCF4 induced the transcription of SLC4A11, an ammonia transporter, to excrete excess ammonia. SLC4A11 was upregulated in HCC tumo","au":["Ye Wang","Chunxiao Cheng","Yanjun Lu","Zhaowu Lian","Qi Liu","Yanchao Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"β-连环蛋白激活重编程氨代谢以促进肝细胞癌的衰老抵抗","zb":"研究发现β-连环蛋白激活通过刺激谷氨酰胺分解增加肝细胞癌中的氨产生，并诱导SLC4A11转运蛋白表达以排出过量氨。抑制SLC4A11可阻断氨外排并诱导癌细胞衰老，降低β-连环蛋白驱动的肿瘤生长，提示靶向SLC4A11是治疗β-连环蛋白突变肝细胞癌的新策略。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.3c17878","t":"Screening Efficient C–N Coupling Catalysts for Electrosynthesis of Acetamide and Output Ammonia through a Cascade Strategy of Electrochemical CO 2 and N 2 Reduction Using Cu-Based Nitrogen–Carbon Nanosheets","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.3c17878","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2024-02-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Due to the limitation of the high-value-added products obtained from electrocatalytic CO 2 reduction within an acid environment, introducing additional elements can expand the diversity of the products obtained during the CO 2 reduction reaction (CO 2 RR) and nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR). Thus, coelectroreduction of CO 2 and N 2 is a new strategy for producing acetamide (CH 3 CONH 2 ) via both C–C and C–N bond coupling using Cu-based nitrogen–carbon nanosheets. CO 2 can reduce to CO, and a key ketene (*C═C═O) can be generated from *CO*CO dimerization; this ketene is postulated as an intermediate in the formation of acetamide. However, most studies focus on promoting the C–C bond formation. Here, we propose that C–N bond coupling can form acetamide through the interaction of *C═C═O with NH 3 . The acetamide is formed via a nucleophilic attack between *NH 3 and the *C═C═O intermediate","au":["Yi Xiao","Chen Shen","Chen Sun","Yibing Yang","Xiao Yang","Lili Han"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"通过电化学 CO2 和 N2 还原的级联策略筛选高效 C–N 耦合催化剂用于乙酰胺电合成和输出氨","zb":"研究对象为 Cu 基氮-碳纳米片，采用电化学 CO2 和 N2 还原方法，筛选高效 C–N 耦合催化剂用于乙酰胺 (CH3CONH2) 电合成和氨输出。通过 CO2 还原生成 CO，CO 二聚化产生关键炔酮 (*C=C=O)，该炔酮被假定为乙酰胺形成中间体。研究发现 Cu2-基石墨和 Cu 基 C3N4 作为催化剂，通过整合 CO 二聚化与乙酰胺合成，可产生 C2+ 化合物。Cu2-基 C2N 和 Cu 基 C3N4 催化剂适合 N2 还原，其中 Cu 基 C3N4 表现出高 CO2 还原和 N2 还原活性，极限电位 (UL) 分别为 -0.83 V 和 -0.58 V。乙酰胺电合成的速率决定步骤 (RDS) 为 *COHCOH 从 *COHCO 的形成。Cu2-基 C2N 的 NH3 合成极限电位为 -0.46 V，*NNH 的形成通过交替路径的 RDS。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d4cc00042k","t":"Plasma-induced nitrogen vacancy-mediated ammonia synthesis over a VN catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4cc00042k","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2024-02-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Plasma catalysis has recently been recognized as a promising route for artificial N 2 reduction under mild conditions. Here we report a highly active VN catalyst for plasma-catalytic NH 3 synthesis via the typical Mars-van Krevelen (MvK) mechanism. Our results indicate that NH 3 synthesis occurs through the continuous regeneration and elimination of nitrogen vacancies on the VN surface. With this strategy, the VN catalyst achieves a superhigh NH 3 yield of 143.2 mg h -1 g cat . -1 and a competitive energy efficiency of 1.43 g NH 3 kW h -1 .","au":["Shijian Luo","Yongduo Liu","Yang Song","Yuran Yang","Fadong Chen","Siguo Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"等离子体诱导的氮空位介导的 VN 催化剂上的氨合成","zb":"研究对象为 VN 催化剂，采用等离子体催化方法，通过典型的 Mars-van Krevelen (MvK) 机制实现 NH3 合成。研究发现 NH3 合成通过 VN 表面氮空位的连续再生和消除发生。该策略下，VN 催化剂实现 NH3 产率为 143.2 mg h-1 gcat-1 的超高产率，以及 1.43 g NH3 kW h-1 的竞争性能量效率。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1007/s00214-024-03101-4","t":"The graphene-supported transition metal cluster as efficient electrocatalyst for nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00214-024-03101-4","s":"Theoretical Chemistry Accounts","d":"2024-02-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jinqiang Li","Jiale Liu","Hui Li","Chaozheng He","Yong Wei","Huijun Kong"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"石墨烯负载的过渡金属簇作为高效的氮还原反应电催化剂","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-02bp6","t":"Chemocatalytic Conversion of Dinitrogen to Ammonia Mediated by a Tungsten Complex","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-02bp6","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2024-02-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Whereas molybdenum dinitrogen complexes have played a major role as catalytic model systems of nitrogenase, corresponding tungsten complexes have in most cases found to be catalytically inactive. Herein we present a modified pentadentate tetrapodal (pentaPod) phosphine ligand in which two dimethylphosphine groups of the original PMe2PPh2 ligand have been replaced with phospholanes (Pln). The derived molybdenum complex [Mo(N2)(PPln2PPPh2)] generates 22 and the analogous tungsten complex [W(N2)(PPln2PPPh2)] 7 equivalents of NH3 from N2 in the presence of 180 equiv.s of SmI2/H2O, rendering the latter the first tungsten complex chemocatalytically converting N2 to NH3. In contrast, the parent tungsten complex [W(N2)(PMe2PPh2)] generates ammonia from N2 only in a slightly overstoichiometric fashion. The reasons for these reactivity differences are investigated with the help of spectroscopic an","au":["Felix Tuczek","Anna-Marlene Vogt","Tobias Adrian Engesser","Jan Krahmer","Niels Michaelis","Mareike Pfeil"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen to Ammonia"],"zt":"由钨配合物介导的 N2 转化为 NH3 的化学催化转化","zb":"研究对象为钨配合物，采用化学催化方法，将 N2 转化为 NH3。通过修饰五齿四足 (pentaPod) 胺配体，其中 PMe2PPh2 配体中的两个二甲基膦基被膦烷 (Pln) 替换，得到 [Mo(N2)(PPln2PPPh2)] 和 [W(N2)(PPln2PPPh2)] 配合物。前者在 SmI2/H2O 存在下产生 22 当量 NH3，后者产生 7 当量 NH3，后者是首个催化 N2 转化为 NH3 的钨配合物。通过光谱和电化学方法研究了这两种配合物的反应活性差异。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.36953/ecj.24602691","t":"Effect of weed and nitrogen management practices on controlling weeds and enhancing the productivity of linseed (Linum usitatissimum L.) under utera conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.36953/ecj.24602691","s":"Environment Conservation Journal","d":"2024-02-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"A field experiment was executed during the Rabi season at CSKHPKV, Palampur, to evaluate the effects of different weed control and nitrogen management practices on weed control, yield, nutrient content, dehydrogenase activity and the oil content of linseed. The experiment was set up in the RBD with 3 replicates consisting of fifteen treatment combinations comprising five weed controls (viz. isoproturon 1.25 kg/ha, clodinafop propargyl + metsulfuron methyl 60+4 g/ha, clodinafop propargyl + carfentrazone ethyl 60+10 g/ha, hand weeding twice and weedy check) and three nitrogen levels (i.e., FYM 5 t/ha, 75 and 100% RDN). The soil texture at the experimental site was silty clay loam, acidic and medium in available nitrogen, phosphorus and potassium. The results showed that the use of clodinafop propargyl + metsulfuron methyl 60+4 g/ha significantly decreased the count and dry matter content o","au":["Narinderpal Singh","Pankaj Chopra","Suresh Kumar","Gurpreet Singh","Navneet Kaur"],"o":"回填","zt":"杂草和氮管理措施对控制杂草和增强亚麻 (Linum usitatissimum L.) 在无土条件下的生产力的影响","zb":"研究对象为亚麻 (Linum usitatissimum L.)，在无土条件下，通过田间实验评估不同杂草控制和氮管理措施对杂草控制、产量、养分含量、脱氢酶活性和油含量的影响。实验设置包括五种杂草控制（异丙隆 1.25 kg/ha、氯氟草酯+甲磺隆 60+4 g/ha、氯氟草酯+氯吡脲乙酯 60+10 g/ha、人工除草两次和无杂草对照）和三种氮水平（腐熟堆肥 5 t/ha、75% 和 100% RDN）。结果表明，氯氟草酯+甲磺隆 60+4 g/ha 显著降低了最大计数和干物质阶段的杂草计数和干物质含量。异丙隆 1.25 kg/ha 同样有效显著减少了杂草计数，且在减少杂草干物质含量方面表现次佳。异丙隆在 1.25 kg/ha（后）的有效杂草控制显著增加了植物生长，无毒性，促进了养分吸收，增加了亚麻的种子、秸秆和油产量。在氮水平中，100% RDN 处理的杂草计数和干物质含量显著较低，其次","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1039/d3ta06666e","t":"A Mo–salicylaldehyde-linker (Mo–Tp) based 2D MOF as a single-atom catalyst for the nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d3ta06666e","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2024-02-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work investigates a Mo–Tp 2D MOF screened from a number of different transition-metal-based 2D MOFs. After exfoliation, the Mo–Tp 2D MOF produces ammonia via the distal pathway at a very low limiting potential of −0.38 V.","au":["Hassan A. Alhadidi Almheiri","Nirpendra Singh","Dinesh Shetty","Kyriaki Polychronopoulou","Ali A. Alhammadi"],"o":"回填","why":["produces ammonia"],"zt":"基于 Mo-salicylaldehyde-linker (Mo-Tp) 的二维 MOF 作为单原子催化剂用于氮还原反应","zb":"筛选自多种过渡金属二维 MOF 的 Mo-Tp 2D MOF 通过远端路径在极低极限电位 −0.38 V 下产生氨。"},{"id":"10.1002/inf2.12535","t":"Establishing carrier transport channels based on Ti  S bonds and enhancing the photocatalytic performance of MXene quantum dots– ZnIn 2 S 4 for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/inf2.12535","s":"InfoMat","d":"2024-02-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract In the process of photocatalytic synthesis of ammonia, the kinetics of carrier separation and transport, adsorption of nitrogen, and activation of the NN triple bond are key factors that directly affect the efficiency of converting nitrogen to ammonia. Here, we report a new strategy for anchoring MXene quantum dots (MXene QDs) onto the surface of ZnIn 2 S 4 by forming TiS bonds, which provide a channel for the rapid separation and transport of charge carriers and effectively extend the lifespan of photogenerated carriers. The unique charge distribution caused by the sulfurization of the MXene QDs further enhances the performance of the photocatalysts for the adsorption and activation of nitrogen. The photocatalytic ammonia synthesis efficiency of MXene QDs–ZnIn 2 S 4 can reach up to 360.5 μmol g −1 h −1 . Density functional theory calculations, various in situ techniques, and ","au":["Xueying Cheng","Renquan Guan","Zhengkai Wu","Yingnan Sun","Weilong Che","Qingkun Shang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于 Ti-S 键构建载流子传输通道并提升 MXene 量子点–ZnIn2S4 的光催化氨合成性能","zb":"MXene量子点（MXene QDs）通过Ti-S键锚定在ZnIn2S4表面，构建载流子快速分离和传输通道，延长光生载流子寿命，并增强对氮吸附和活化的性能。MXene QDs–ZnIn2S4的光催化氨合成效率高达360.5 μmol g −1 h −1 。利用密度泛函理论计算、原位技术和超快光谱表征了Ti-S键构建、激发态载流子动态及其对氮吸附活化与光催化氨合成效率的影响。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.24425/cpe.2024.149462","t":"Gliding discharge plasma-catalytic system for decomposition of ammonia as a chemical carrier of hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.24425/cpe.2024.149462","s":"Chemical and Process Engineering: New Frontiers","d":"2024-02-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Hydrogen has been identified as an essential component of a decarbonized and sustainable energy system. The use of hydrogen is associated with the problem of its storage and distribution. Storing hydrogen in the gaseous state is energy-consuming, mainly due to the process of its compression. A much higher density of hydrogen can be obtained after its liquefaction. Hydrogen can also bond in chemical compounds, for example, in ammonia which contains 17.8% hydrogen by weight. The aim of the work was to examine the ammonia decomposition process in the plasma-catalytic system and to determine the effect of the process parameters on energy consumption. The applied catalysts allowed higher ammonia conversion than the homogeneous system. The lowest energy consumption, 593 kJ/molH2, was obtained for the 10% Fe/Al2O3 catalyst. The highest ammonia conversion (approx. 90%) was obtained using the 10%","au":["Michał Młotek","Maria Ogrodowska","Michalina Perron","Bogdan Ulejczyk","Krzysztof Krawczyk"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"用于分解氨作为氢载体的滑动放电等离子体催化系统","zb":"氨分解过程在等离子体催化系统中研究，并确定工艺参数对能耗的影响。10% Fe/Al2O3催化剂实现高于均相系统的氨转化率，最低能耗为593 kJ/molH2；10% Co/Al2O3催化剂获得最高氨转化率（约90%）。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1002/cey2.491","t":"Strategies to achieve effective nitrogen activation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cey2.491","s":"Carbon Energy","d":"2024-02-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia serves as a crucial chemical raw material and hydrogen energy carrier. Aqueous electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR), powered by renewable energy, has attracted tremendous interest during the past few years. Although some achievements have been revealed in aqueous NRR, significant challenges have also been identified. The activity and selectivity are fundamentally limited by nitrogen activation and competitive hydrogen evolution. This review focuses on the hurdles of nitrogen activation and delves into complementary strategies, including materials design and system optimization (reactor, electrolyte, and mediator). Then, it introduces advanced interdisciplinary technologies that have recently emerged for nitrogen activation using high‐energy physics such as plasma and triboelectrification. With a better understanding of the corresponding reaction mechanisms ","au":["Bin Chang","Huabin Zhang","Shuhui Sun","Gaixia Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen activation . Abstract Ammonia"],"zt":"实现有效氮活化的策略","zb":"氨作为关键化工原料和氢能载体，水相电催化氮还原反应（NRR）利用可再生能源具有巨大潜力。该综述聚焦氮活化障碍，探讨材料设计和系统优化（反应器、电解质和介质）等互补策略，并介绍利用高能物理如等离子体和摩擦电效应等新兴的跨学科技术。目标是提供对选择性及稳定性反应机制的深入理解，并推荐NRR性能研究详细方案，强调与先进跨学科应用、原位/操作条件表征和理论计算结合的潜在研究方向。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.202313086","t":"A Metal Coordination Number Determined Catalytic Performance in Manganese Borides for Ambient Electrolysis of Nitrogen to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202313086","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2024-02-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract A new strategy that can effectively increase the nitrogen reduction reaction performance of catalysts is proposed and verified by tuning the coordination number of metal atoms. It is found that the intrinsic activity of Mn atoms in the manganese borides (MnB x ) increases in tandem with their coordination number with B atoms. Electron‐deficient boron atoms are capable of accepting electrons from Mn atoms, which enhances the adsorption of N 2 on the Mn catalytic sites (*) and the hydrogenation of N 2 to form *NNH intermediates. Furthermore, the increase in coordination number reduces the charge density of Mn atoms at the Fermi level, which facilitates the desorption of ammonia from the catalyst surface. Notably, the MnB 4 compound with a Mn coordination number of up to 12 exhibits a high ammonia yield rate (74.9 ± 2.1 µg h −1 mg cat −1 ) and Faradaic efficiency (38.5 ± 2.7%) at −","au":["Muhammad Asim Mushtaq","Anuj Kumar","Wei Liu","Qianqian Ji","Yonggui Deng","Ghulam Yasin"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"金属配位数确定的催化性能在锰硼化物中用于环境电解氮合成氨","zb":"通过调节金属原子配位数提出并验证了一种有效提高催化剂氮还原反应性能的新策略。Mn 原子的本征活性随其与 B 原子配位数的增加而提高。缺电子的 B 原子能从 Mn 原子接受电子，增强 N 2 在 Mn 催化位点 (*) 的吸附和氢化形成 *NNH 中间体。配位数增加降低了 Mn 原子在费米能级的电荷密度，促进了氨从催化剂表面的解吸。MnB4化合物具有高达12的 Mn 配位数，在−0.3 V 对可逆氢电极（RHE）和0.1 m Li2SO4电解质中表现出高氨产率（74.9 ± 2.1 µg h −1 mg cat −1 ）和法拉第效率（38.5 ± 2.7%），超过其他硼相关催化剂。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adma.202311341","t":"Underpotential Deposition of 3D Transition Metals: Versatile Electrosynthesis of Single‐Atom Catalysts on Oxidized Carbon Supports","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202311341","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2024-02-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Use of single‐atom catalysts (SACs) has become a popular strategy for tuning activity and selectivity toward specific pathways. However, conventional SAC synthesis methods require high temperatures and pressures, complicated procedures, and expensive equipment. Recently, underpotential deposition (UPD) has been investigated as a promising alternative, yielding high‐loading SAC electrodes under ambient conditions and within minutes. Yet only few studies have employed UPD to synthesize SACs, and all have been limited to UPD of Cu. In this work, a flexible UPD approach for synthesis of mono‐ and bi‐metallic Cu, Fe, Co, and Ni SACs directly on oxidized, commercially available carbon electrodes is reported. The UPD mechanism is investigated using in situ X‐ray absorption spectroscopy and, finally, the catalytic performance of a UPD‐synthesized Co SAC is assessed for electrochemical n","au":["Aidan Francis Meese","Cade Napier","David J. Kim","Kali Rigby","Tayler Hedtke","Denis Leshchev"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"三维过渡金属的阴极沉积：在氧化碳载体上合成单原子催化剂的多功能电合成","zb":"阴极沉积（UPD）作为一种替代方法，在环境条件下和几分钟内合成高负载单原子催化剂（SACs）。本研究报道了在市售氧化碳电极上直接合成单金属和双金属 Cu、Fe、Co 和 Ni SACs 的柔性 UPD 方法。通过原位X射线吸收光谱研究了 UPD 机制，并评估了 UPD 合成 Co SAC 对电化学硝酸盐还原为氨的催化性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202311336","t":"Electrical‐Driven Directed‐Evolution of Copper Nanowires Catalysts for Efficient Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202311336","s":"Small","d":"2024-02-22","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrocatalytic conversion of nitrate (NO 3 − ) to NH 3 (NO 3 RR) at ambient conditions offers a promising alternative to the Haber–Bosch process. The pivotal factors in optimizing the proficient conversion of NO 3 − into NH 3 include enhancing the adsorption capabilities of the intermediates on the catalyst surface and expediting the hydrogenation steps. Herein, the Cu/Cu 2 O/Pi NWs catalyst is designed based on the directed‐evolution strategy to achieve an efficient reduction of NO 3 ‾. Benefiting from the synergistic effect of the O V ‐enriched Cu 2 O phase developed during the directed‐evolution process and the pristine Cu phase, the catalyst exhibits improved adsorption performance for diverse NO 3 RR intermediates. Additionally, the phosphate group anchored on the catalyst's surface during the directed‐evolution process facilitates water electrolysis, thereby generati","au":["Wenjie Luo","Zeyi Guo","Ling Ye","Shilu Wu","Yingyang Jiang","Peng Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"电驱动的定向进化铜纳米线催化剂用于高效硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"以环境条件下的硝酸盐（NO3-）电催化还原为氨（NO3RR）替代哈伯-博施工艺具有前景。优化NO3-高效转化为NH3的关键因素包括增强催化剂表面中间体的吸附能力和加速加氢步骤。本研究基于定向进化策略设计Cu/Cu2O/Pi NWs催化剂以实现高效的NO3-还原。定向进化过程中发展的富O V-Cu2O相和原始Cu相的协同效应提高了催化剂对多种NO3RR中间体的吸附性能。此外，定向进化过程中锚定在催化剂表面的磷酸基促进了水电解，从而在催化剂表面产生H吸附并促进NO3RR的加氢步骤。结果表明，Cu/Cu2O/Pi NWs催化剂对NH3的优异法拉第效率（FE）为96.6%，在1 m KOH和0.1 m KNO3溶液中-0.5 V vs RHE下NH3产率率为1.2 mol h-1 g cat-1。此外，磷酸基对Cu2O相的稳定作用增强了催化剂的稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.55730/1300-0527.3648","t":"Nonoxidative dehydrogenation of propane using boron-incorporated silica-supported Pt Sites synthesized by atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.55730/1300-0527.3648","s":"Turkish Journal of Chemistry","d":"2024-02-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Nonoxidative dehydrogenation of propane to propylene using Pt-based supported catalysts is an active research area in catalysis because catalyst attributes of Pt sites can be controlled by careful design of active sites. One way to achieve this is by the addition of a second metal that may impart a change in the electron density of active sites, which in turn affects catalytic performance. In this study, bimetallic Pt and B sites were deposited on powder SiO2 using atomic layer deposition (ALD). Boron was first deposited on SiO2 via half-cycle ALD using triisoproplyborate as the B source. Following calcination, Pt deposition was performed via half-cycle ALD using trimethyl(methylcyclopentadienyl)platinum(IV) as the Pt source. The synthesized catalysts were reduced under H2 at 550 °C and characterized using inductively coupled plasma optical emission spectroscopy for elemental analysis, d","au":["Gokhan ÇELİK"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"使用原子层沉积合成的硼掺杂二氧化硅负载 Pt 位点的非氧化脱氢丙烷","zb":"使用原子层沉积 (ALD) 在粉末 SiO2 上沉积双金属 Pt 和 B 位点。首先通过半循环 ALD 使用三异丙氧基硼作为 B 源将 B 沉积在 SiO2 上。在煅烧后，使用四甲基(甲基环戊二烯)铂(IV)作为 Pt 源通过半循环 ALD 进行 Pt 沉积。合成的催化剂在 550 °C 下用 H2 还原，并使用电感耦合等离子体光学发射光谱进行元素分析，使用吸附 CO 的漫反射红外傅里叶变换光谱检查 Pt 的性质，使用时间分辨 X 射线吸收近边结构光谱检查 Pt 位点的还原性变化。然后使用固定床活塞流反应器在 550 °C 下测试样品的非氧化脱氢丙烷，以检查 B 对催化性能的作用。表征结果表明，B 的添加增加了电子密度并影响了 Pt 位点的还原性。此外，在 SiO2 上添加 B 为 Pt ALD 创建了锚定位点。在 B/SiO2 上沉积的 Pt 量是 SiO2 上的 2.2 倍。催化活性结","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1007/s11814-024-00035-2","t":"Hydrogen Plasma-Assisted Atomic Layer Deposition of Ru with Low Oxygen Content","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11814-024-00035-2","s":"Korean Journal of Chemical Engineering","d":"2024-02-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ru is extensively used in electrical and energy applications because of its high electrical conductivity and catalytic activity. This study reports the H2 plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition (PEALD) of Ru thin films using a novel carbonyl cyclohexadiene ruthenium precursor. The optimized process conditions for depositing Ru thin films by PEALD were established based on the growth per cycle (GPC), chemical formation, crystallinity, conformality, and resistivity, according to process parameters such as precursor pulse time, H2 plasma pulse time, purge time, and deposition temperature. Pure Ru thin films (low carbon and oxygen) were deposited with low resistivity (30.8 μΩ cm) and showed high conformality (> 95%) on the Si trenches. The oxidant-free PEALD Ru process reported in this study may have implications on the fabrication of high-quality interfaces between Ru and easily-oxidized s","au":["Geonwoo Park","Keunhoi Kim","Jeong Woo Shin","Geongu Han","Dohyun Go","Jihwan An"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"氢等离子体辅助原子层沉积具有低氧含量的 Ru","zb":"报道了使用新型羰基环己二烯钌前驱体进行 H2 等离子体增强原子层沉积 (PEALD) 的 Ru 薄膜沉积。基于生长每循环 (GPC)、化学形成、结晶度、均匀性和电阻率，根据前驱体脉冲时间、H2 等离子体脉冲时间、吹扫时间和沉积温度等工艺参数，建立了沉积 Ru 薄膜的优化工艺条件。沉积了纯 Ru 薄膜（低碳和氧），电阻率低 (30.8 μΩ cm)，在 Si 槽上均匀性高 (> 95%)。该研究报道的无氧化剂 PEALD Ru 工艺对 Ru 和易氧化基底的界面高质量制造可能具有启示意义。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.3c12780","t":"Nonmetal Atom Doping Induced Orbital Shifts and Charge Modulation at the Edge of Two-Dimensional Boron Carbonitride Leading to Enhanced Photocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.3c12780","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2024-02-21","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Electronic structure, particularly charge state analysis, plays a crucial role in comprehending catalytic mechanisms. This study focuses on metal-free boron carbonitride (BCN) nanosheets as a case study to investigate the impact of heteroatom doping on the charge state of active sites at the edge of two-dimensional (2D) metal-free nanomaterials. Our observations revealed that the doping induces a shift in the frontier p y orbital near the Fermi level, accompanied by alterations in its charge state. These changes provide insights into the nitrogen adsorption descriptors and the critical hydrogenation step, ultimately leading to the proposal of a competitive charge transfer mechanism. Additionally, this exploration has led to the screening of five BCN-type structures (P@T 1 -C 1, S@T 1 -B 1, O@T 1 -B 1, P@T 1 -B 1 C 2, and P@T 1 -B 1 C 3 ) with promising nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) p","au":["Youchao Kong","Xiaoshuang Li","Alain R. Puente Santiago","Tianwei He"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"非金属原子掺杂诱导二维硼碳氮化物的边缘轨道偏移和电荷调制，从而增强光催化氮还原","zb":"电子结构，特别是电荷态分析，在理解催化机制中起着关键作用。本研究以金属-free硼碳氮化物（BCN）纳米片为例，研究杂原子掺杂对二维（2D）无金属纳米材料活性位点电荷态的影响。研究发现，掺杂导致费米能级附近的p y轨道发生偏移，并伴随其电荷态的变化。这些变化提供了氮吸附描述符和关键加氢步骤的见解，最终提出了竞争电荷转移机制。此外，该研究筛选了五种具有良好氮还原反应（NRR）性能的BCN型结构（P@T1-C1, S@T1-B1, O@T1-B1, P@T1-B1C2和P@T1-B1C3）。S@T1-B1结构表现出最低的NRR过电位达到-0.2 V，这与提出的电荷竞争机制相关。此外，研究深入探讨了关键加氢机制、描述符和构型关系的火山图。此外，提出的掺杂策略使2D-BCN对太阳光谱更加敏感，表明其可作为潜在的光催化剂。总体而言，该研究为非金属原子掺杂BCN纳米片在氮还原应用中的发展奠定了坚实基础","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202303809","t":"New Mechanistic Insights into Electrokinetic Competition Between Nitrogen Reduction and Hydrogen Evolution Reactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202303809","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2024-02-21","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Achieving both high activity and selectivity presents a significant challenge for electrochemical N 2 reduction (eNRR) due to the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Although density functional theory‐based computations can identify eNRR‐favored electrocatalysts, there is a significant gap between theoretical predictions and experimental observations. In this work, a comprehensive analysis of the kinetic competition between eNRR and HER at the electrode‐electrolyte interface (EEI) from three perspectives: kinetic N 2 adsorption, *N 2 hydrogenation, and corresponding potential‐dependent kinetics is presented. This data reveals that N 2 adsorption at EEI is kinetically facile. Upon *N 2 adsorption, the subsequent hydrogenation is influenced by electrode potentials. At lower overpotentials, *N 2 hydrogenation is more facile than HER. However, at higher overpotentials, eNRR","au":["Lin Jiang","Xiaowan Bai","Xing Zhi","Yan Jiao"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电化学氮还原与析氢反应动力竞争的新机制见解","zb":"通过分析电极-电解质界面的动力学竞争，揭示了电化学氮还原反应(eNRR)与析氢反应(HER)的竞争机制。研究发现，在低过电位下* N2氢化比HER更易进行，而在高过电位下受限于界面N2可用性，eNRR动力学劣势导致HER占主导。增强界面N2浓度是提高eNRR活性的关键。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.3c16456","t":"Ammonia Synthesis via Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction Using NiCoO 2 Nanoarrays on a Copper Foam","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.3c16456","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2024-02-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH 3 ) plays a vital role in industrial and agricultural development. The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (eNO 3 RR) is an effective method to produce NH 3 under environmental conditions but also requires considerably active and selective electrocatalysts. Herein, a copper foam was used as a conductive substrate for the electrode materials. Specifically, a Co metal–organic framework (Co-MOF) was in situ grown on the copper foam, etched, and calcined to form NiCoO 2 @Cu nanosheets, which were used as cathode electrodes for the eNO 3 RR. In 0.1 M Na 2 SO 4 with 0.1 M NaNO 3 electrolyte, NiCoO 2 @Cu nanosheets realized an NH 3 yield of 5940.73 μg h –1 cm –2 at −0.9 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE), with a Faradaic efficiency of 94.2% at −0.7 V vs RHE. After 33 h of the catalytic reaction, the selectivity of NH 3 –N increased to 99.7%. The excellent electrocataly","au":["Yan Hai","Xiaoman Li","Yue Cao","Xinyan Wang","Linghu Meng","Yang Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过NiCoO2纳米阵列在铜泡沫上的电催化硝酸盐还原合成氨","zb":"氨（NH3）在工业和农业发展中起着至关重要的作用。电催化硝酸盐还原反应（eNO3RR）是在环境条件下有效生产NH3的方法，但需要具有高活性和选择性的电催化剂。本研究使用铜泡沫作为导电基底电极材料。具体地，在铜泡沫上原位生长Co金属-有机框架（Co-MOF），蚀刻和煅烧形成NiCoO2@Cu纳米片，用作eNO3RR的阴极电极。在0.1 M Na2SO4和0.1 M NaNO3电解液中，NiCoO2@Cu纳米片在-0.9 V vs RHE下实现了5940.73 μg h-1 cm-2的NH3产率，在-0.7 V vs RHE下法拉第效率为94.2%。在33 h的催化反应后，NH3-N的选择性增加到99.7%。NiCoO2@Cu纳米片的优异电催化性能归因于双金属材料中Ni原子和Co原子的明显协同效应。研究表明，NiCoO2@Cu纳米片中的Ni掺杂有效地促进了NO3-在NiCoO2@Cu上的吸附，","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cphc.202300451","t":"Efficient Nitrogen Reduction on Weyl Antiferromagnet Mn 3 Sn","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cphc.202300451","s":"ChemPhysChem","d":"2024-02-21","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Topological semimetals have gradually emerged as excellent catalysts owing to their robust surface states. Recently, Mn 3 X (X=Sn, Ge, and Ir), which exhibits noncollinear antiferromagnetic phases at room temperature, has been found to possess energy bands that are characteristic of Weyl semimetals. In this study, we demonstrate that the perfect Mn 3 Sn (001) surface is favorable for N 2 reduction with a low onset potential. According to a theoretical criterion, the catalytic performance of the (001) surface of Mn 3 Sn is higher than that of the (001) surfaces of the homologues Cr 3 Sn and Mo 3 Sn. The construction and catalytic performance of other types of Mn 3 Sn surfaces are also investigated. Our findings highlight the feasibility of applying topological Weyl semimetals as electrocatalysts for N 2 reduction.","au":["Xi Chen","Zheng‐Zhe Lin"],"o":"回填","zt":"在Weyl反铁磁体Mn3Sn上的高效氮还原","zb":"拓扑半金属因其鲁棒表面态逐渐成为优异催化剂。最近发现室温下具有非共线性反铁磁相的Mn3X（X=Sn, Ge, Ir）具有Weyl半金属特征能带。本研究表明完美的Mn3Sn (001)表面有利于N2还原且具有低起始电位。理论标准表明Mn3Sn的(001)表面催化性能高于同族Cr3Sn和Mo3Sn的(001)表面。研究了其他类型Mn3Sn表面的构建和催化性能。研究结果表明拓扑Weyl半金属作为N2还原电催化剂的可行性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.202301110","t":"Decarbonizing Steam‐Methane Reforming: Enhancing Activity through Joule Heating of a Ni/ZrO 2 ‐Coated FeCrAl Coil","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.202301110","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2024-02-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract This study investigates Joule (resistive) heating as a potential method to electrify the heating process in steam‐methane reforming. The significance and relevance of this research are driven by three factors: (1) increasing global demand for hydrogen as feedstock for chemical manufacturing and refining; (2) expanding hydrogen as a carbon‐free energy carrier; and (3) decarbonizing the production sector of the hydrogen value chain. FeCrAl metal wire coils coated uniformly with Ni/ZrO 2 catalyst were used in the Joule heating experiments. The resistive power was supplied in the range 50–90 W by varying voltage across the wire. Results show a notable, sharp increase in methane conversion at a power exceeding 60 W (750 °C estimated wire temperature). The results are compared with those for a conventionally‐heated coated wire as well as Joule‐heated uncoated ZrO 2 ‐only wires to eluc","au":["Elmer B. Ledesma","Meghana Idamakanti","Praveen Bollini","Michael P. Harold","Ram R. Ratnakar"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"脱碳蒸汽甲烷重整：通过 Ni/ZrO2-包覆 FeCrAl 线圈的焦耳加热提高活性","zb":"研究了焦耳（电阻）加热作为蒸汽甲烷重整中加热过程电气化的潜在方法。这项研究的意义和相关性是由三个因素驱动的：(1) 对作为化学制造和炼油原料的氢气的全球需求不断增加；(2) 氢气作为无碳能源载体的应用扩展；(3) 脱碳氢价值链的生产部门。在焦耳加热实验中使用了均匀包覆有 Ni/ZrO 2 催化剂的 FeCrAl 金属线线圈。通过改变跨线圈的电压，电阻功率在 50–90 W 范围内提供。结果表明，当功率超过 60 W 时（估计线圈温度为 750 °C），甲烷转化率显着、急剧增加。将结果与常规加热的包覆线圈的以及仅未包覆的 ZrO 2 线圈的焦耳加热结果进行比较，以阐明 Ni 和 ZrO 2 的作用以及加热方法之间的差异。在一定功率范围内，焦耳加热的 Ni/ZrO 2 包覆线圈的甲烷转化率高于常规加热的 Ni/ZrO 2 包覆线圈。结果表明，在所研究的实验条件下，催化剂包覆线圈的焦耳加热对蒸汽","ob":"其他催化反应｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-8ltp5","t":"Elucidating the Role of Strain in Catalysis toward Modulating Surface-Adsorbate Interactions and Tuning Catalytic Activity","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-8ltp5","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2024-02-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Strain has been shown to modulate adsorption and reactions on metal surfaces. While its effect on surface-adsorbate interactions has been rationalized, an understanding of the electronic factors that drive these interactions and their consequences on catalytic activity is lacking. In this work, we use ab initio density functional theory (DFT) and microkinetic modeling (MKM) to develop electronic descriptors that govern the effect of biaxial strain in the modulation of interactions between adsorbate and transition states with catalyst surface and report its significance in enhancing the activity of fcc Pd(111) in the synthesis of ammonia (NH3), an important renewable-energy and hydrogen (H2) vector. We established the p-band center (pcenter) of the adsorbates and transition states (TS) and the hybridized d-band center (dcenter) of the surface metal as key electronic descriptors for adsorb","au":["Siddhesh S Borkar","Manish Shetty"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zt":"阐明应变在催化中的作用：调节表面吸附物相互作用和调整催化活性","zb":"应变已被证明可以调节金属表面的吸附和反应。虽然其对面部吸附物相互作用的影响已被合理化，但对于驱动这些相互作用并对其催化活性的影响缺乏了解。在这项工作中，我们使用从头算密度泛函理论 (DFT) 和微观动力学建模 (MKM) 来开发控制双轴应变调节吸附物和催化剂表面与过渡态之间相互作用的电子描述符，并报告其在提高 fcc Pd(111) 在氨 (NH3) 合成中的活性方面的意义，氨是一种重要的可再生能源和氢 (H2) 载体。我们建立了吸附物和过渡态 (TS) 的 p 带中心 (pcenter) 以及表面金属的杂化 d 带中心 (dcenter) 作为吸附物和 TS 能量随应变变化的关键电子描述符。具体来说，吸附最强的位点的吸附物的 pcenter 最低，表面金属原子的 dcenter 上移最大，吸附位点具有最高应变敏感性（即吸附能随单位施加应变的改变）。重要的是，我们表明与周期性缩放关系相比，","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202304287","t":"High‐Throughput Ammonia Production from Nitrate Using Liquid Metal Synthesized Bismuth Nano‐Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202304287","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2024-02-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The implementation of renewable energy sources to electrify ammonia (NH 3 ) production is identified as a critical approach for achieving successful decarburization in the pursuit of a more sustainable future. A liquid metal‐based method is presented for synthesizing bismuth (Bi) nano‐electrocatalysts, enabling efficient and sustainable ammonia production via nitrate electroreduction. Bi‐metal precipitated from a gallium liquid metal alloy yields solution‐processable Bi and oxide with controllable nanostructures such as nanosheets, nanotubes, and nanoparticles. Combining Bi nano‐electrocatalysts and graphene liquid crystals creates self‐assembling layered electrocatalytic systems. Integrating 3D printing technology allows for precise control over the geometry, microporosity, and number of deposited layers of the electrocatalytic scaffold electrode, resulting in improved mass tra","au":["Sahar Nazari","Jing Sun","Mahroo Baharfar","Philippe Poulin","Kourosh Kalantar‐Zadeh","Ali (Rouhollah) Jalili"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"利用液体制备的铋纳米催化剂从硝酸盐高效生产氨","zb":"将可再生能源用于电解氨（NH3）生产被认为是实现成功脱碳以追求更可持续未来的关键方法。本研究提出了一种基于液态金属的方法合成铋（Bi）纳米电催化剂，通过硝酸盐电还原实现高效和可持续的氨生产。从镓液态金属合金中沉淀的Bi-金属产生可溶液加工的Bi和氧化物，具有可控的纳米结构，如纳米片、纳米管和纳米颗粒。将Bi纳米电催化剂与石墨烯液晶结合形成自组装分层电催化系统。集成3D打印技术允许精确控制电催化支架电极的几何形状、微孔隙率和沉积层数量，从而改善传质性能、耐久性和防止催化剂脱落。结果表明，氨生产速率达到400 nmol s-1 cm-2，法拉第效率超过90%，电流密度超过350 mA cm-2。这些数据表明所提出的电催化系统具有优异的可扩展性潜力。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.3c07969","t":"Ultrasmall Iron Nanoparticle-Decorated Carbon Black for High-Efficiency Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrosynthesis and Zinc-Nitrate Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.3c07969","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2024-02-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction offers a low-carbon approach to producing ammonia at ambient conditions. However, the development of low-cost but efficient catalysts for ammonia production is still challenging. Herein, we report iron nanoparticles directly decorated carbon black (Fe@C-900) as a low-cost electrocatalyst for high-efficiency nitrate-to-ammonia electrosynthesis, which shows a maximum ammonia Faraday efficiency (FE) of 99% at −0.5 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE), a high ammonia yield rate of 12,082 μg h –1 cm –2 at −0.8 V versus RHE, and long-term stability. Combined in situ electrochemical analyses and nitrite reduction tests reveal that the NO 2 * species are the key intermediates for ammonia production. Comparative experiments reveal that iron nanoparticles serve as active sites to produce active hydrogen for further ammonia electrosynthesis. More import","au":["Yingjia Liu","Ruyi Cheng","Huixia Ren","Tengfei Sun","Dong Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"超小铁纳米颗粒装饰碳黑用于高效硝酸盐至氨电合成和锌硝酸盐电池","zb":"研究对象为铁纳米颗粒装饰碳黑（Fe@C-900）作为低成本电催化剂，用于高效硝酸盐至氨电合成。关键方法为电化学制备和表征，结果显示在-0.5 V vs RHE下氨法拉第效率高达99%，-0.8 V vs RHE下氨产率速率为12,082 μg h⁻¹ cm⁻²，并具有长期稳定性。Zn-NO₃⁻电池测试表明，Fe@C-900阴极可实现12 mW cm⁻²的高功率密度和99%的氨法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202309500","t":"Mechanocatalytic Synthesis of Ammonia by Titanium Dioxide with Bridge‐Oxygen Vacancies: Investigating Mechanism from the Experimental and First‐Principle Approach","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202309500","s":"Small","d":"2024-02-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract Mechanochemical ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis is an emerging mild approach derived from nitrogen (N 2 ) gas and hydrogen (H) source. The gas‐liquid phase mechanochemical process utilizes water (H 2 O), rather than conventional hydrogen (H 2 ) gas, as H sources, thus avoiding carbon dioxide (CO 2 ) emission during H 2 production. However, ammonia yield is relatively low to meet practical demand due to huge energy barriers of N 2 activation and H 2 O dissociation. Here, six transition metal oxides (TMO) such as titanium dioxide (TiO 2 ), iron(III) oxide (Fe 2 O 3 ), copper(II) oxide (CuO), niobium(V) oxide(Nb 2 O 5 ), zinc oxide (ZnO), and copper(I) oxide (Cu 2 O) are investigated as catalysts in mechanochemical N 2 fixation. Among them, TiO 2 shows the best mechanocatalytic effect and the optimum reaction rate constant is 3.6‐fold higher than the TMO‐free process. The theoretical cal","au":["Chengli He","Yang Chen","Zixiang Hao","Linrui Wang","Mingyan Wang","Xiaoli Cui"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"含桥氧空位二氧化钛机械催化合成氨：实验与第一性原理机制研究","zb":"研究六种过渡金属氧化物作为催化剂在机械化学氮固定中的作用，其中TiO2效果最佳，反应速率常数比无催化剂过程高3.6倍。理论计算表明，N2分子倾向于以侧向吸附在TiO2 (101)晶面的机械诱导桥氧空位上，而H2O在此处更易解离提供H原子，从而实现温和条件下的氨合成。","ob":"机械化学制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系｜机械力驱动"},{"id":"10.1038/s41598-024-54678-6","t":"Polypyrrole-wool composite with electrical heating properties fabricated via layer-by-layer method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-024-54678-6","s":"Scientific Reports","d":"2024-02-16","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract This study presents the development of conductive polymer-textile composites with outstanding electric heating properties achieved through the in-situ polymerization of polypyrrole on wool-felt fabrics, renowned for their superior thermal insulation. Employing successive layer-by-layer (LBL) cycles facilitated precise control over the uniform deposition of polypyrrole with the fabrics. The investigation focused on the interaction between wool fiber and polypyrrole, evaluating appearance, add-on, and electrical heating performance with varying LBL cycles. The polymerization process resulted in the formation of spherical polypyrrole particles on the wool-felt, with deposition increasing alongside LBL cycle numbers. Mechanical properties, including tensile strength and bending rigidity, exhibited enhancement with polypyrrole deposition, while strain reduction was noted, with minima","au":["Suhyun Lee"],"o":"回填","why":["electrical heat"],"zt":"聚吡咯-羊毛复合物电加热性能的制备","zb":"通过逐层法原位聚合法制备具有优异电加热性能的导电聚合物-纺织复合材料。研究聚焦于羊毛纤维与聚吡咯的相互作用，评估了外观、添加量和电加热性能随逐层循环次数的变化。聚吡咯在羊毛毡上形成球形颗粒，沉积量随逐层循环次数增加而增加。聚吡咯沉积后，拉伸强度和弯曲刚度增强，应变减少，逐层循环次数影响较小。表面电阻等电性能在第二次逐层循环后快速下降。电加热性能方面，12 V电压下表面温度随逐层循环次数线性增加，峰值达15.5 ℃。这种电加热效果在电压移除后仍可持续，归因于羊毛纤维的低导热性。聚吡咯导电层在反复磨损和洗涤后仍保持优异导电性，归因于逐层循环的均匀性改善。羊毛的绝缘性和聚吡咯的导电性协同作用，展现出高效加热织物的潜力。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpclett.4c00233","t":"Lewis Acid Mediated Alteration of Electron Density on a Copper Site via pπ-dπ Mixing Enhances the Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.4c00233","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters","d":"2024-02-16","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Strategic modulation of the electronic structure of the catalyst to foster the electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) to the ammonia process significantly is still an area that needs to be explored. Herein, we report the incorporation of the Lewis acid into an electron-rich copper site regulating the electron density of the metal, which has been experimentally proved from the d-band center position to have a direct influence on the adsorption of N 2 compared to the protons. The catalyst boron doped copper-cuprous oxide hybrid system (B–Cu/Cu 2 O) has shown promising Faradaic efficiency of 32% at −0.2 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE) compared to the pristine cuprous oxide (Cu 2 O(N)) system. The in situ Fourier transform infrared study confirms the presence of intermediates evolved during the electroreduction process. This study demonstrates the design of the active ce","au":["Surajit Samui","Ramendra Sundar Dey"],"o":"回填","why":["produce ammonia"],"zt":"通过配位酸介导的pπ-dπ混合改变铜位点的电子密度增强电化学氮还原反应","zb":"研究通过引入配位酸调节富电子铜位点的电子密度，实验证明d带中心位置对N₂吸附有直接影响。B掺杂的铜-氧化亚铜混合体系（B–Cu/Cu₂O）在-0.2 V vs RHE下显示出32%的法拉第效率，优于原始氧化亚铜（Cu₂O(N)）体系。原位傅里叶变换红外研究证实了电还原过程中中间体的存在。该研究展示了通过pπ-dπ键-反键方法设计活性中心的特定推-拉相互作用，为电化学活化并还原N₂制氨提供了见解。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jchemed.3c01150","t":"Synthesis of Lead Dioxide and Evaluation of Its Electrocatalytic Performance in Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jchemed.3c01150","s":"Journal of Chemical Education","d":"2024-02-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Although the present university-level chemistry experimental curriculum has been extensive and well-designed, it lacks a connection with the scientific research field, especially the frontier field. It is crucial to incorporate recent discoveries through new experiment designs to bridge this gap and boost the value of the undergraduate experimental course. Under the background of advancing with the times, this paper integrates the scientific research results of electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis (through nitrogen reduction reaction, NRR) into the undergraduate teaching classes, which is conducive to improving students’ scientific analysis ability and their green environmental awareness. Two lead dioxide catalysts with different crystal phases were prepared on a carbon cloth substrate by a simple water bath method. The structure, composition, and morphology of the two catalysts were chara","au":["Wei Xiong","Huhu Yin","Xiujing Xing","Hao Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"二氧化铅的合成及其在氨合成中的电催化性能评价","zb":"通过简单水浴法在碳布基材上制备了两种不同晶相的二氧化铅催化剂，并对其结构、组成和形貌进行了表征，探索了两种催化剂的电催化氨合成性能。实验项目覆盖了无机、分析和物理化学的教学内容，培养了学生的基本实验操作技能和现代仪器分析材料结构的能力，提高了学生的科学研究和环保意识。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/aesr.202300284","t":"Recent Progress of Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia on Copper‐Based Catalysts: From Nanoparticles to Single Atoms","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aesr.202300284","s":"Advanced Energy and Sustainability Research","d":"2024-02-16","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH 3 ) is a vital chemical for modern human society. It is conventionally produced by the energy‐ and emission‐intensive Haber–Bosch process. Alternatively, sustainable NH 3 production from renewable electricity‐driven electrolyzers has emerged as a promising route. Particularly, NH 3 synthesis from nitrate (NO 3 − ), a common pollutant in water and soil, by the nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) has drawn wide attention. Among various catalysts demonstrated recently, copper (Cu)‐based catalysts have been recognized as attractive candidates due to their availability, good activity, high NH 3 selectivity, and facile reaction kinetics. In this review, the recent progress of Cu‐based NO 3 RR catalysts from the reaction mechanistic fundamentals to various catalyst design strategies, aiming at providing an on‐time summary, is summarized, and perspectives that can guide the rational","au":["Zixun Yu","Mingyao Gu","Yangyang Wang","Hao Li","Yuan Chen","Li Wei"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"铜基催化剂电化学硝酸盐还原制氨的最新进展：从纳米颗粒到单原子","zb":"综述了利用可再生电力驱动电解槽从硝酸盐(NO3-)还原合成氨的进展，重点总结了铜基催化剂从反应机理到各种设计策略的最新成果。文章旨在为理性设计和按需设计铜及其他丰富金属基催化剂提供指导，以实现可持续的氨生产。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/2162-8777/ad26a3","t":"Synthesis and Characterization of Flower-Like Cobalt-Doped ZnO Nanostructures for Ammonia Sensing Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/2162-8777/ad26a3","s":"ECS Journal of Solid State Science and Technology","d":"2024-02-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The future trajectory of gas sensor development focuses mainly on two key aspects: minimizing power consumption and enhancing the capability to detect hazardous gases at lower concentrations under ambient conditions. The present study used the co-precipitation method to explore the synthesis of zinc oxide and cobalt-doped ZnO sensors, encompassing a range of cobalt concentrations from 1 wt% to 4 wt%. The synthesized samples undergo comprehensive analysis to evaluate their structural, morphological, optical, and gas-sensing properties. X-ray Diffraction (XRD) revealed a hexagonal Wurtzite structure, and the crystallite size decreased from 16.92 to 15.39 nm. Energy-Dispersive X-ray spectroscopy (EDX) and Fourier-Transform Infrared (FTIR) Spectroscopy collectively affirmed the presence of cobalt. Scanning Electron Microscopy (SEM) was used to analyze the morphological characteristics. The T","au":["B. Himabindu","N. S. M. P. Latha Devi","P. Nagaraju","B. Rajini Kanth"],"o":"回填","zt":"花状钴掺杂ZnO纳米结构的合成及其在氨传感应用中的表征","zb":"采用共沉淀法制备了不同钴浓度（1 wt%至4 wt%）的ZnO和钴掺杂ZnO传感器，并对其结构、形貌、光学和气敏性能进行了综合分析。XRD显示六方纤锌矿结构，晶粒尺寸从16.92 nm降至15.39 nm。EDX和FTIR证实了钴的存在。SEM分析了形貌特征，Tauc-plot通过漫反射光谱测定光学带隙，从3.18 eV增至3.23 eV。AFM和BET分析评估了表面形貌和孔径分布，粗糙度从435 nm增至700 nm，比表面积从18.657 m²/g增至21.962 m²/g，孔径从3.67 nm增至3.72 nm。Co掺杂ZnO传感器在室温下对挥发性有机化合物（VOCs）的气敏性能测试显示，4%钴掺杂的传感器对2 ppm NH₃表现出21 s的响应和20 s的恢复时间。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202315248","t":"Ultrafast Carbothermal Shock Synthesis of Wadsley–Roth Phase Niobium‐Based Oxides for Fast‐Charging Lithium‐Ion Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202315248","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2024-02-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Wadsley–Roth phase niobium‐based oxides show potential as anode candidates for fast‐charging lithium‐ion batteries. Traditional synthesis methods, however, usually involve a time‐consuming calcination process, resulting in poor production efficiency. Herein, a novel carbothermal shock (CTS) method that enables the ultra‐fast synthesis of various Wadsley–Roth phase Nb‐based oxides within seconds is introduced. The extremely rapid heating rates enabled by CTS alter the reaction mechanism from a sluggish solid‐state process to a swift liquid‐phase assisted one and drive the chemical reactions away from equilibrium, thereby generating abundant oxygen vacancies and dislocations. Theoretical calculations reveal that oxygen vacancies significantly lower the energy barrier for Li + diffusion and enhance the intrinsic electronic conductivity. Moreover, dislocations help convert the surfa","au":["Qilong Wu","Yuanhong Kang","Guanhong Chen","Jianken Chen","Minghui Chen","Wei Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Carbothermal Shock"],"zt":"超快碳热冲击合成Wadsley-Roth相铌基氧化物用于快速充电锂离子电池","zb":"Wadsley-Roth相铌基氧化物作为锂离子电池负极材料具有潜力，但传统合成方法耗时。本研究引入碳热冲击（CTS）方法，可在秒级内合成各种Wadsley-Roth相Nb基氧化物。CTS的极快加热速率改变了反应机制，从固相慢速过程转变为液相辅助快速过程，并使化学反应远离平衡，从而产生丰富的氧空位和位错。理论计算表明，氧空位显著降低了Li+扩散的能量势垒，并增强了本征电子电导率。此外，位错有助于将Li+插层产生的表面拉伸应力转化为压缩应力，有效提高循环过程中的结构完整性。该方法也可用于在常温下合成LiFePO4正极材料，无需惰性气氛。CTS合成的Nb14W3O44||LiFePO4电池表现出优异的循环能力（4 A g−1下3000循环后容量衰减率为0.0065%），并具有增强的热稳定性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaem.3c02892","t":"Recent Advances in Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction: Strategies To Promote Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaem.3c02892","s":"ACS Applied Energy Materials","d":"2024-02-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate-to-ammonia conversion is a promising and alternative sustainable approach for replenishing the nitrogen cycle pathway under mild conditions. Developing high-performance functional catalysts is the key to improving the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR), which directly affects the overall reaction pathway and production rate. Various strategies have been proposed to accelerate catalyst interfacial electron transfer and increase the selectivity toward ammonia production. This paper timely reviews the controllable tactics used to design highly efficient electrocatalysts for ammonia production, including defect modification, crystal regulation, and composite engineering. Simultaneously, perspectives on the main factors that influence the activity and selectivity of the NO 3 RR from various engineered materials are also provided. Finally, we propose","au":["Tianhang Ding","Mingli Wang","Fangjun Wu","Bin Song","Ke Lu","Hong Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"电化学硝酸盐还原的最新进展：促进氨合成的策略","zb":"电化学硝酸盐至氨转化是一种在温和条件下补充氮循环途径的可持续方法。开发高性能功能催化剂是提高电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NO₃RR）的关键，直接影响整体反应途径和产率。本文综述了用于设计高效氨合成催化剂的可控策略，包括缺陷改性、晶体调控和复合工程。同时提供了影响NO₃RR活性选择性的主要因素从各种工程材料的视角。最后，提出了优化电催化剂的主要问题、未来趋势以及电化学NO₃RR实际工业应用的潜在挑战。克服这些限制将促进先进电化学NO₃RR技术的发展。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d3mh02141f","t":"Deciphering the bridge oxygen vacancy-induced cascading charge effect for electrochemical ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d3mh02141f","s":"Materials Horizons","d":"2024-02-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Annealing-assisted vacancy engineering in SnO 2 produces bridge oxygen vacancies where Sn atoms (A, B) adjacent to the vacancy undergo end-on followed by side-on N 2 adsorption owing to charge contortion and kinetically facilitate the NRR process.","au":["Ashmita Biswas","Narad Barman","Avinash Nambron","Ranjit Thapa","Kathi Sudarshan","Ramendra Sundar Dey"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"解析桥氧空位诱导的级联电荷效应用于电化学氨合成","zb":"通过退火辅助的 SnO 2 空位工程产生桥氧空位，其中 Sn 原子（A、B）邻近空位经历端向随后侧向 N 2 吸附，这是由于电荷扭曲和动力学促进 NRR 过程。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smtd.202301373","t":"Fast and Sensitive Detection of Ammonia from Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction Reactions by 1 H NMR with Radiation Damping","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smtd.202301373","s":"Small Methods","d":"2024-02-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract A facile NMR method is reported for analysis of ammonia from the electrochemical reduction of nitrogen, which compares a calibrated colorimetric method, a calibrated 1 H NMR method and two 1 H NMR direct measurements using external reference materials. Unlike spectrophotometric methods, 1 H NMR requires less bench time and does not require separation of ammonia from the electrolyte. A novel approach to the problem of radiation damping in NMR measurements considered the specific role of hardware tuning. Radiation damping is suppressed improving signal‐to‐noise ratio and detection limit (1.5 µg L −1 ). The method is demonstrated to be effective for the analysis of ammonia from direct electrochemical nitrogen reduction in KOH, and from lithium‐mediated nitrogen reduction in a non‐aqueous solution. An uncertainty budget is prepared for the measurement of ammonia.","au":["Aya Assafiri","Chen Jia","Donald S. Thomas","David B. Hibbert","Chuan Zhao"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Reduction Reaction"],"zt":"通过 1 H NMR 快速和灵敏检测电化学氮还原反应中的氨","zb":"报道了一种简便的 NMR 方法用于分析电化学还原氮产生的氨，并与校准的比色法、校准的 1 H NMR 方法和两种使用外部参考材料的 1 H NMR 直接测量方法进行比较。与分光光度法不同，1 H NMR 需要更少的台面时间，并且不需要将氨与电解质分离。提出了一种解决 NMR 测量中辐射阻尼问题的新方法，考虑了硬件调整的特定作用。辐射阻尼被抑制，提高了信噪比和检测限（1.5 µg L −1 ）。该方法被证明对分析 KOH 中的直接电化学氮还原以及非水溶液中锂介导的氮还原中的氨是有效的。准备了氨测量的不确定度预算。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/cryst14020188","t":"Thermodynamics of Iron Ammonia Synthesis Catalyst Sintering","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/cryst14020188","s":"Crystals","d":"2024-02-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The sintering of iron ammonia synthesis catalysts (nanocrystalline iron promoted with: Al2O3, CaO and K2O) was studied under a hydrogen atmosphere, in a temperature range of 773 to 973 K to obtain stationary states. The catalysts were characterized by measuring the nitriding reaction rate under an ammonia atmosphere at 748 K to obtain steady states and the measurement of specific surface area. Chemical processes were conducted in a tubular differential reactor enabling thermogravimetric measurements and the chemical composition analysis of a gas phase under conditions allowing experiments to be carried out in the kinetic region of chemical reactions. An extended model of the active surface of the iron ammonia synthesis catalyst was presented, taking into account the influence of the gas phase composition and process temperature. The surface of iron nanocrystallites was wetted using promo","au":["Walerian Arabczyk","Rafał Pelka","Izabella Jasińska","Zofia Lendzion-Bieluń"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"铁氨合成催化剂烧结的热力学","zb":"研究Al2O3、CaO和K2O助催化的纳米晶铁氨合成催化剂在773至973 K下的烧结热力学。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.4c00251","t":"Mxene-Cu Electrified Membranes with Confined Lamellar Channels for the Flow-through Electrochemical Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.4c00251","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2024-02-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical conversion of nitrate to valuable ammonia is a promising but challenging study of wastewater treatment and resource recovery. Herein, we reported an MXene-Cu lamellar electrified membrane with confined channels as a flow-through electrode for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis by nitrate (NO 3 – ) reduction. The introduction of Cu nanoparticles into Ti 3 C 2 T x -stacked membranes could broaden their plane channels to improve the mass transfer while confining their permeability to achieve modulation of the water flux. By coordination of the catalytic capacity of Cu nanoparticles as well as the tunable water flux, the Ti 3 C 2 T x -Cu flow-through membrane electrodes exhibited excellent electrocatalytic performance. Particularly, in a closed-cycle flow-through mode, the optimized Ti 3 C 2 T x -Cu membranes were able to convert NO 3 – to NH 3 efficiently, even at high feed concentra","au":["Xin Yang","Guanbao Wei","Jihui Cao","Zhengxin Ding","Rusheng Yuan","Jinlin Long"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate to Ammonia"],"zt":"具有限域层状通道的 Mxene-Cu 电化膜用于硝酸盐到氨的流动电化学还原","zb":"硝酸盐到有价值氨的电化学转化是废水处理和资源回收中一项有前景但具有挑战性的研究。在此，我们报道了一种具有限域通道的 MXene-Cu 层状电化膜作为硝酸盐（NO 3 – ）还原的流动电极，通过电化学合成氨（NH 3 ）。将 Cu 纳米颗粒引入 Ti 3 C 2 T x -堆叠膜中可以拓宽它们的平面通道以改善传质，同时限制它们的渗透性以实现水通量的调节。通过 Cu 纳米颗粒的催化能力以及可调水通量的协调，Ti 3 C 2 T x -Cu 流动膜电极表现出优异的电催化性能。特别地，在闭环流动模式下，优化的 Ti 3 C 2 T x -Cu 膜能够有效地将 NO 3 – 转化为 NH 3，即使在高进料浓度下也是如此。此外，这些膜电极不仅具有优异的长期耐久性，而且由于其固有的排斥能力，对有机染料污染具有抵抗力，这允许它们在复杂溶液中保持稳定的电催化性能。这项工作表明，使用具有限域通道的 MXene","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1080/1536383x.2024.2312164","t":"Direct Z-scheme photocatalytic removal of ammonia via the narrow band gap BiOCl/g-C 3 N 4 hybrid catalyst upon visible light irradiation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/1536383x.2024.2312164","s":"Fullerenes, Nanotubes and Carbon Nanostructures","d":"2024-02-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"In this study, a novel BiOCl/g-C3N4 heterojunction photocatalyst was successfully prepared. The resulting BiOCl/g-C3N4 catalyst can degrade NH3 effectively to N2 under visible-light irradiation. We used BiOCl-modified g-C3N4 nanoparticles to improve the activity of photochemically produced oxygen species. Photocurrent showed excellent photocatalysis performance of BiOCl/g-C3N4. The deposition of BiOCl resulted in a fatal decrease in the surface part and pore volume of the BiOCl/g-C3N4 samples. It was found that the photocurrent density increased with g-C3N4. Experimental results indicate that heterogeneous catalysts achieved 89.7 % degradation under visible light irradiation. The NH3 degradation product was N2 and neither NO2− nor NO3− were detected.","au":["Qingqing Yao","Kai Chen","Won-Chun Oh"],"o":"回填","zt":"在可见光照射下，通过窄带隙 BiOCl/g-C 3 N 4 混合催化剂的直接 Z 型光电催化去除氨","zb":"在这项研究中，成功制备了一种新型 BiOCl/g-C3N4 异质结光催化剂。所得 BiOCl/g-C3N4 催化剂可以在可见光照射下有效地将 NH3 降解为 N2。我们使用 BiOCl 修饰的 g-C3N4 纳米颗粒来提高光化学产生的活性氧物种的活性。光电流显示出 BiOCl/g-C3N4 的优异光催化性能。BiOCl 的沉积导致 BiOCl/g-C3N4 样品的表面部分和孔体积急剧下降。发现光电流密度随着 g-C3N4 的增加而增加。实验结果表明，异质催化剂在可见光照射下实现了 89.7 % 的降解。NH3 降解产物是 N2，未检测到 NO2− 或 NO3−。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.3c16406","t":"Surface Electronic Properties-Driven Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction on Metal-Conjugated Porphyrin 2D-MOFs","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.3c16406","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2024-02-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Two-dimensional (2D) metal organic framework (MOF) or metalloporphyrin nanosheets with a stable metal-N 4 complex unit present the metal as a single-atom catalyst dispersed in the 2D porphyrin framework. First-principles calculations on the 3d-transition metals in M-TCPP are investigated in this study for their surface-dependent electronic properties including work function and d-band center. Crystal orbital Hamiltonian population (-pCOHP) analysis highlights a higher contribution of the bonding state in the M–N bond and antibonding state in the N–N bond to be essential for N–N bond activation. A linear relationship between Δ G max and surface electronic properties, N–N bond strength, and Bader charge has been found to influence the rate-determining potential for nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) in M-TCPP MOFs. 2D Ti-TCPP MOF, with a kinetic energy barrier of 1.43 eV in the final proton","au":["Ashakiran Maibam","Ibrahim B. Orhan","Sailaja Krishnamurty","Salvy P. Russo","Ravichandar Babarao"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"表面电子性质驱动的金属-共轭卟啉二维金属有机框架上的电催化氮还原","zb":"研究金属-共轭卟啉二维金属有机框架（MOF）或金属卟啉纳米片，其中包含稳定的金属-N4复合单元，将金属作为单原子催化剂分散在二维卟啉框架中。通过第一性原理计算研究了M-TCPP中的3d过渡金属的表面依赖性电子性质，包括功函数和d带中心。晶体轨道哈密顿布居（-pCOHP）分析表明，M-N键的成键态和N-N键的反键态对N-N键活化的贡献较高。研究发现ΔGmax与表面电子性质、N-N键强度和Bader电荷之间存在线性关系，这些因素影响M-TCPP MOFs中氮还原反应（NRR）的速率决定电位。二维Ti-TCPP MOF在酶促NRR最终质子化步骤的动力学能垒为1.43 eV，对竞争性的氢还原（HER）和氮氧化物（NO和NO2）表现出专一的NRR选择性。因此，在水溶剂中具有-0.35 V的NRR限制电位，提议Ti-TCPP MOF作为电催化NRR的吸引人候选者。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/advs.202308979","t":"Ambient Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis: From Theoretical Guidance to Catalyst Design","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.202308979","s":"Advanced Science","d":"2024-02-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia, a vital component in the synthesis of fertilizers, plastics, and explosives, is traditionally produced via the energy‐intensive and environmentally detrimental Haber–Bosch process. Given its considerable energy consumption and significant greenhouse gas emissions, there is a growing shift toward electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis as an eco‐friendly alternative. However, developing efficient electrocatalysts capable of achieving high selectivity, Faraday efficiency, and yield under ambient conditions remains a significant challenge. This review delves into the decades‐long research into electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis, highlighting the evolution of fundamental principles, theoretical descriptors, and reaction mechanisms. An in‐depth analysis of the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) and nitrate reduction reaction (NitRR) is provided, with a focus on their electrocataly","au":["Jianjia Mu","Xuan‐Wen Gao","Tong Yu","Lu‐Kang Zhao","Wen‐Bin Luo","Huicong Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"环境电化学氨合成：从理论指导到催化剂设计","zb":"氨是合成肥料、塑料和炸药的重要成分，传统上通过能耗高且对环境有害的哈伯-博施过程生产。鉴于其巨大的能源消耗和显著的温室气体排放，人们越来越倾向于电催化氨合成作为一种环保的替代方案。然而，开发能够在环境条件下实现高选择性、法拉第效率和产率的电催化剂仍然是一个重大挑战。本综述深入探讨了数十年来对电催化氨合成的研究，重点介绍了基本原理、理论描述符和反应机理的演变。提供了对氮还原反应（NRR）和硝酸盐还原反应（NitRR）的深入分析，重点关注它们的电催化剂。此外，还考察了用于氨合成电催化剂设计的理论，包括吉布斯自由能方法、萨巴蒂尔原理、d-带中心理论和轨道自旋状态。本综述最终全面概述了当前面临的挑战和未来发展方向，为 NRR 和 NitRR 的电催化剂开发铺平了道路，为更可持续的氨生产方法铺平了道路。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.iecr.3c04306","t":"Demethylation of Waste Alkali Lignin for Rapid and Efficient Ammonia Adsorption","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.iecr.3c04306","s":"Industrial & Engineering Chemistry Research","d":"2024-02-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Alkali lignin, a significant waste resource from the pulp and paper industry, is produced in large quantities each year, but its utilization remains limited. This study focuses on the cleavage of –OCH 3 groups attached to the aromatic ring in alkali lignin to obtain demethylated alkali lignin nanospheres (DAL-NPs) enriched with aromatic hydroxyl (Ar–OH) groups. These DAL-NPs are intended for the efficient adsorption of NH 3 . Qualitative and quantitative characterization of alkali lignin, both pre- and post-demethylation, was performed using Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy and 1 H NMR. The analysis revealed a reduction in methoxy groups and an increase in Ar–OH groups in the DAL-NPs. The NH 3 adsorption experiment demonstrated that the DAL-NPs exhibited a rapid and high adsorption capacity, reaching an NH 3 uptake capacity of 10.0 mmol g –1 within 0.42 min at 298 K and 1.0 bar. I","au":["Jian-Fei Li","Zhang-Min Li","Jian-Bo Xu","Cheng-Yong Guo","Guo-Wen Fang","Yan Zhou"],"o":"回填","zt":"废弃碱木质素的去甲基化用于快速和高效的氨吸附","zb":"碱木质素是造纸工业的重要废弃物资源，每年生产量巨大，但其利用仍然有限。本研究着重于断裂附着在芳香环上的 –OCH 3 基团，以获得富含芳香醇（Ar–OH）基团的去甲基化碱木质素纳米球（DAL-NPs）。这些 DAL-NPs 用于高效的 NH 3 吸附。使用傅里叶变换红外光谱和 1 H NMR 对碱木质素进行了定性和定量表征，无论是在去甲基化前还是后。分析显示，DAL-NPs 中的甲氧基减少，Ar–OH 基团增加。NH 3 吸附实验表明，DAL-NPs 表现出快速和高吸附容量，在 298 K 和 1.0 bar 下，0.42 min 内达到 10.0 mmol g –1 的 NH 3 吸附量。此外，DAL-NPs 在 298 K 和 1.0 bar 下基于理想吸附溶液理论表现出优异的选择性，对 10% NH 3 /90% N 2 (3252) 和 10% NH 3 /90% CO 2 (17","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202304106","t":"Progress in Single/Multi Atoms and 2D‐Nanomaterials for Electro/Photocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction: Experimental, Computational and Machine Leaning Developments","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202304106","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2024-02-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The conversion of atmospheric nitrogen (N 2 ) into ammonia (NH 3 ), known as nitrogen fixation, plays a crucial role in sustaining life on Earth, facing innovation with electrocatalytic and photocatalytic methods. These approaches promise gentler conversions from atmospheric nitrogen to ammonia, diverging from the energy‐intensive Haber‐Bosch process, which requires complex plant infrastructure. Vitality lies in eco‐friendly, cost‐effective, and energy‐efficient pathways. The challenge is that electrocatalysts and photocatalysts for nitrogen reduction have shown low Faraday efficiency, hampered by hydrogen evolution. This work delves into recent strides in electro/photo‐catalytic nitrogen fixation/reduction, deciphering mechanisms, catalysts, and prospects. By unveiling the core principles steering these processes, it dissects efficiency drivers. Experimental and theoretical stu","au":["Aditya Narayan Singh","Rohit Anand","Mohammad Zafari","Miran Ha","Kwang S. Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"电/光催化氮还原中单/多原子与二维纳米材料的进展：实验、计算与机器学习发展","zb":"综述了电催化和光催化将大气氮(N2)转化为氨(NH3)的最新进展，探讨了催化剂、机理及前景。文章涵盖了从密度泛函计算到机器学习筛选催化剂的实验和理论研究，重点评估了嵌入二维材料中的单/多原子催化剂、异质结构及助催化剂技术。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d4nr00060a","t":"Photoelectrochemical-driven nitrogen reduction to ammonia by a V o -SnO 2 /TiO 2 composite electrode","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4nr00060a","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2024-02-09","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"A heterostructured V o -SnO 2 /TiO 2 electrode with high PEC nitrogen fixation activity and faradaic efficiency is constructed and the effect of V o in SnO 2 on the N 2 adsorption and activation is analyzed.","au":["Junbo Ma","Jiangjian Fu","Lan Sun","Jun Cheng","Jian-Feng Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"光电化学驱动的氮还原为氨的V0-SnO2/TiO2复合电极","zb":"构建了具有高PEC氮固定活性和法拉第效率的异质结构V0-SnO2/TiO2电极，并分析了V0在SnO2中对N2吸附和活化的影响。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.3c05629","t":"Unveiling the Structure–Property Relationship of MgO-Supported Ni Ammonia Decomposition Catalysts from Bulk to Atomic Structure by In Situ/Operando Studies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.3c05629","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2024-02-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"High Resolution Image Download MS PowerPoint Slide Ammonia is currently being studied intensively as a hydrogen carrier in the context of the energy transition. The endothermic decomposition reaction requires the use of suitable catalysts. In this study, transition metal Ni on MgO as a support is investigated with respect to its catalytic properties. The synthesis method and the type of activation process contribute significantly to the catalytic properties. Both methods, coprecipitation (CP) and wet impregnation (WI), lead to the formation of Mg 1– x Ni x O solid solutions as catalyst precursors. X-ray absorption studies reveal that CP leads to a more homogeneous distribution of Ni 2+ cations in the solid solution, which is advantageous for a homogeneous distribution of active Ni catalysts on the MgO support. Activation in hydrogen at 900 °C reduces nickel, which migrates to the support","au":["Tolga H. Ulucan","Jihao Wang","Ezgi Onur","Shilong Chen","Malte Behrens","Claudia Weidenthaler"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"通过原位/操作工况研究从体相到原子结构揭示 MgO 载 Ni 氨分解催化剂的结构-性能关系","zb":"研究对象为 MgO 载 Ni 氨分解催化剂的结构-性能关系，采用共沉淀 (CP) 和湿浸渍 (WI) 方法制备催化剂。关键方法是 X 射线吸收研究、原位 X 射线衍射 (XRD) 和操作工况总散射实验，揭示 CP 和 WI 制备的催化剂在体相和原子水平上的结构差异。CP 样品具有更均匀的 Ni2+ 阳离子分布，但需要更苛刻的条件才能激活；WI 样品 Ni 粒子更大 (20–30 nm)，而 CP 样品 Ni 粒子较小 (10–20 nm)。","ob":"氨分解制氢","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202317414","t":"Enhanced Charge Carrier Dynamics on Sb 2 Se 3 Photocathodes for Efficient Photoelectrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202317414","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2024-02-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH 3 ) is recognized as a transportable carrier for renewable energy fuels. Photoelectrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (PEC NO 3 RR) offers a sustainable solution for nitrate‐rich wastewater treatment by directly converting solar energy to ammonia. In this study, we demonstrate the highly selective PEC ammonia production from NO 3 RR by constructing a CoCu/TiO 2 /Sb 2 Se 3 photocathode. The constructed CoCu/TiO 2 /Sb 2 Se 3 photocathode achieves an ammonia Faraday efficiency (FE) of 88.01 % at −0.2 V RHE and an ammonia yield as high as 15.91 μmol h −1 cm −2 at −0.3 V RHE with an excellent onset potential of 0.43 V RHE . Dynamics experiments and theoretical calculations have demonstrated that the CoCu/TiO 2 /Sb 2 Se 3 photocathode possesses high light absorption capacity, excellent carrier transfer capability, and high charge separation and transfer efficiencies. Th","au":["Shijie Ren","Rui‐Ting Gao","Nhat Truong Nguyen","Lei Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Sb2Se3光电阴极上电荷载体动力学增强用于高效光电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"通过构建CoCu/TiO2/Sb2Se3光电阴极，实现了从NO3RR中高选择性地生产氨。CoCu/TiO2/Sb2Se3光电阴极在-0.2 V RHE下实现了88.01 %的氨法拉第效率，在-0.3 V RHE下实现了高达15.91 μmol h−1 cm−2的氨产率，并具有0.43 V RHE的优异起始电位。动力学实验和理论计算表明，CoCu/TiO2/Sb2Se3光电阴极具有高光吸收能力、优异的电荷转移能力和高电荷分离和转移效率。该光电阴极能有效吸附反应物NO3−和中间体，CoCu助剂增加了NO3RR和HER之间的最大吉布斯自由能差。同时，Co物种增强了Cu的自旋密度，并增加了pdos近费米能级的态密度，从而在CoCu/TiO2/Sb2Se3上实现了高PEC NO3RR活性。这项工作为从富硝酸盐废水中高效PEC氨合成提供了新的途径。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2023-1s6n8-v2","t":"Engineering a molecular electrocatalytic system for energy-efficient ammonia production from wastewater nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2023-1s6n8-v2","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2024-02-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Haber-Bosch ammonia production and utilization has sustained exponential population growth but exacerbated wastewater nitrate pollution. Abundant nitrate pollutants could be refined to purified nitrogenous chemicals with the electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR). However, the dilute and impure composition of nitrate-rich wastewaters presents barriers to realizing practical electrocatalytic systems that to date operate most efficiently in concentrated, pure electrolytes. These barriers inform our investigation of the ammonia-selective homogeneous molecular NO3RR catalyst Co(DIM). In this work, we elucidate interfacial mechanisms of catalysis inhibition that describe Co(DIM)-mediated NO3RR performance in complex electrolyte compositions. These mechanisms inform design principles for a novel reactive separations platform, electrocatalyst-in-a-box (ECaB), that exhibits the lowes","au":["Dean Miller","Matthew Liu","Kristen Abels","Anna Kogler","Kindle Williams","William Tarpeh"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"为能源高效氨生产从废水硝酸盐中工程化设计分子电催化系统","zb":"研究对象为从废水硝酸盐中高效生产氨的分子电催化系统，重点研究了 Co(DIM) 催化剂在复杂电解质中的性能。关键方法是阐明催化抑制的界面机制，并设计新型反应分离平台电催化剂-盒子 (ECaB)，其从实际废水中生产纯化氨的能量消耗最低 (90.0 ± 2.7 kWh kg-N–1)。该研究展示了基于机理洞察和复杂水相电化学废水精炼系统性能的迭代设计方法。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.3c17530","t":"Boosting the Faraday Efficiency of Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis via the Strain Effect Induced by Interfacial Hybrid Formation between BN and Carbon Nanotubes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.3c17530","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2024-02-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) is a highly promising alternative to the Haber–Bosch (H–B) process, but its commercial development is limited by the high bond energy of N 2 molecules and the presence of the competitive hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Here, a metal-free composite electrocatalyst of boron nitride (h-BNNs) and carbon nanotubes (CNTs) was explored through the interfacial hybridization of h-BNNs and CNTs, which showed a highly improved eNRR Faraday efficiency (FE) of 63.9% and an NH 3 yield rate of 36.5 μg h –1 mg cat. –1 at −0.691 V (vs RHE). New chemical bonds of C–B and C–N were observed, indicating a strong interaction between CNTs and h-BNNs. According to the Raman spectra and the optimized model of h-BNNs/CNTs, an obvious strain effect between h-BNNs and CNTs was supposed to play a significant role in the highly improved FE, compared with the F","au":["Meng Zhang","Lihua Shen","Chunxia Yu","Tian Li","Shuaishuai Bai","Yanwei Su"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过 BN 和碳纳米管之间界面杂化诱导的应变效应增强电化学氨合成法拉第效率","zb":"研究对象为电化学氮还原反应 (eNRR) 的法拉第效率 (FE) 增强，探索了通过 BN 和碳纳米管 (CNTs) 的界面杂化制备的金属自由复合电催化剂。关键方法是界面杂化制备催化剂，并通过 Raman 光谱和 DFT 计算揭示 BN/CNTs 之间的应变效应在提高 FE (63.9%) 和氨产率 (36.5 μg h –1 mg cat. –1) 方面的重要作用。BN/CNTs 具有更低的 eNRR 能垒，从而提高了 N2 到 NH3 的选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s12274-024-6480-1","t":"Boosting electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia via Cu2O/Cu(OH)2 heterostructures promoting electron transfer","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s12274-024-6480-1","s":"Nano Research","d":"2024-02-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate ( $${\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{O}}_3}^ -$$ ) reduction to ammonia (NH3) offers a viable approach for sustainable NH3 production and environmental denitrification. Copper (Cu) possesses a distinctive electronic structure, which can augment the reaction kinetics of $${\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{O}}_3}^ -$$ and impede hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), rendering it a promising contender for the electrosynthesis of NH3 from $${\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{O}}_3}^ -$$ . Nevertheless, the role of Cu2O in copper-based catalysts still requires further investigation for a more comprehensive understanding. Herein, the Cu2O/Cu(OH)2 heterostructures are successfully fabricated through liquid laser irradiation using CuO nanoparticles as a precursor. Experimental and theoretical researches reveal that Cu2O/Cu(OH)2 heterostructure exhibits enhanced electrocatalytic performance for $${\\rm{N}}{{\\rm{O}}_3}^ -$$ to NH3 beca","au":["Jing Geng","Sihan Ji"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"通过 Cu2O/Cu(OH)2 异质结构促进电子转移来增强电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐 ($${ m{N}}{{ m{O}}_3}^ -$$) 还原为氨 (NH3)，采用液激光照射法制备 Cu2O/Cu(OH)2 异质结构。关键方法是液激光照射法制备催化剂，并通过实验和理论研究揭示 Cu(OH)2 促进电子转移和降低 Cu2O 中 Cu 活性位点的价态，从而增强电催化性能。在 -0.6 V (vs. 可逆氢电极 (RHE)) 下，氨产率达到最大值 1630.66 ± 29.72 $${ m{\\mu g}} \\cdot {{ m{h}}^{ - 1}} \\cdot { m{m}}{{ m{g}}_{{ m{cat}}}}^{ - 1}$$，法拉第效率 (FE) 最大值为 76.95% ± 5.51%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s12274-024-6474-z","t":"Heterostructure Cu3P−Ni2P/CP catalyst assembled membrane electrode for high-efficiency electrocatalytic nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s12274-024-6474-z","s":"Nano Research","d":"2024-02-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) is a promising means for generating the energy carrier ammonia. Herein, we report the synthesis of heterostructure copper-nickel phosphide electrocatalysts via a simple vapor-phase hydrothermal method. The resultant catalysts were evaluated for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NH 3 ) in three-type electrochemical reactors. In detail, the regulation mechanism of the heterogeneous Cu 3 P−Ni 2 P/CP− x for NO 3 RR performance was systematically studied through the H-type cell, rotating disk electrode setup, and membrane-electrode-assemblies (MEA) electrolyzer. As a result, the Cu 3 P−Ni 2 P/CP−0.5 displays the practicability in an MEA system with an anion exchange membrane, affording the largest ammonia yield rate ( R NH3 ) of 1.9 mmol·h −1 ·cm −2 , exceeding most of the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction electrocatalysts rep","au":["Meng Jin","Jiafang Liu","Xian Zhang","Shengbo Zhang","Wenyi Li","Dianding Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"异质结构Cu3P-Ni2P/CP催化剂组装膜电极用于高效电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NO3 RR）是生成能量载体氨的一种有前景的方法。在此，我们报告通过简单的气相水热法合成了异质结构铜-镍磷化物电催化剂。在三种类型电化学反应器中对所得催化剂进行了电催化硝酸盐还原为氨（NH3）的评价。详细研究了异质结构Cu3P-Ni2P/CP-x对NO3 RR性能的调节机制，通过H型电池、旋转圆盘电极装置和膜电极组件（MEA）电解槽。结果表明，Cu3P-Ni2P/CP-0.5在具有阴离子交换膜的MEA系统中表现出实用性，提供了1.9 mmol·h −1 ·cm −2的最大氨产率（R NH3 ），超过迄今为止报道的大多数电催化硝酸盐还原电催化剂。理论计算和原位光谱表征揭示，Cu3P-Ni2P/CP中形成的异质界面有利于通过连续的加氢脱氧途径促进硝酸盐吸附、活化和转化为氨。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s12274-024-6470-3","t":"Electron engineering of nickel phosphide for Niδ+ in electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s12274-024-6470-3","s":"Nano Research","d":"2024-02-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia (ENRA) provides an efficient approach to remove nitrate pollution and achieve ammonia production simultaneously. Herein, inspired by bio-enzyme in denitrifying bacteria, a carbon-coated nickel phosphide (NiPC) nanosheet derived from metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) is proposed as an efficient catalyst for ENRA. Through electron engineering, controllable Ni δ+ in nickel phosphide is achieved by regulating the degree of phosphating, which enhances its activity for the hydrogenation of nitrate. As the result, Ni δ+ becomes one of dominating factors determining the efficiency of the ENRA reaction in nickel phosphide. The optimal NiPC catalyst exhibits impressive property toward ENRA: NH 4 + Faraday efficiency of 96.68%, NH 4 + selectivity of 99.04%, and nitrate conversion rate of 90.43% under low nitrate concentration (200 mgL −1 ). This wor","au":["Jie Hu","Hao Huang","Miao Yu","Shuang Wang","Jinping Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"镍磷化合物的电子工程用于Niδ+在电化学硝酸盐还原为氨中的作用","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原为氨（ENRA）为去除硝酸盐污染和同时实现氨生产提供了一种有效方法。在此，受反硝化细菌中生物酶的启发，提出了一种由金属有机框架（MOFs）衍生的碳包覆镍磷化物（NiPC）纳米片作为高效的ENRA催化剂。通过磷化程度调节，实现了镍磷化物中可控的Ni δ+，增强了其硝酸盐加氢的活性。结果表明，Ni δ+成为决定镍磷化物中ENRA反应效率的主要因素。优化的NiPC催化剂在低硝酸盐浓度（200 mgL −1 ）下表现出对ENRA的优异性能：NH4+法拉第效率为96.68%，NH4+选择率为99.04%，硝酸盐转化率为90.43%。这项工作通过电子工程为ENRA的下一代催化剂设计开辟了新途径。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/aic.18357","t":"Flash Joule ‐heating synthesis of MoO 2 nanocatalysts in graphene aerogel for deep catalytic oxidative desulfurization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aic.18357","s":"AIChE Journal","d":"2024-02-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Ultra‐high‐temperature flash Joule‐heating of organometallic precursor‐embedded reduced graphene oxide (rGO) aerogel represents a highly efficient approach for the ultrafast production of nanocatalysts, while such a methodology has been scarcely applied to 3D nanocarbon‐based aerogel monoliths. Herein, we demonstrate the rapid synthesis of MoO 2 nanoparticles within the aerogel matrix via a 1‐s high‐temperature flash Joule‐heating process (~1700°C), resulting in the formation of the hybrid MoO 2 @rGO aerogel with uniformly distributed nanoparticles. Nitrogen adsorption/desorption analysis indicates discernible internal microstructural disparities attributed to the additional 1‐s flash‐heating and the substantial generation of MoO 2 nanoparticles. This aerogel exhibits exceptional catalytic functionality, achieving up to 99.8% efficiency in converting dibenzothiophene to dibenzot","au":["Dong Xia","Heng Li","Peng Huang","Wenyu Zhou","Alexander Kulak","Ningjing Luo"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳热合成MoO2纳米催化剂在石墨烯气凝胶中用于深度催化氧化脱硫","zb":"通过1秒高温闪焦耳热处理嵌入还原石墨烯氧化物（rGO）气凝胶中的有机金属前驱体，实现了纳米催化剂的超快生产。该过程在气凝胶基质中快速合成了MoO2纳米颗粒，形成了具有均匀分布纳米颗粒的混合MoO2@rGO气凝胶。氮吸附/脱附分析表明，额外的1秒闪热和大量MoO2纳米颗粒的产生导致了内部微观结构的差异。该气凝胶表现出优异的催化功能，将二苯并噻吩转化为二苯并噻吩砜的效率高达99.8%。密度泛函理论计算揭示了催化机理，表明Mo中心显示出来自富电子石墨烯基底的累积电子密度。这种电子密度增强显著提高了催化活性，实现深度脱硫。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202313307","t":"Recent Progress of Ru Single‐Atom Catalyst: Synthesis, Modification, and Energetic Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202313307","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2024-02-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract In recent years, single‐atom catalysts (SACs) have become the most active part of the catalytic field due to their excellent catalytic activity. Among them, Ru SACs exhibit excellent performance in many catalytic applications due to their high atomic utilization efficiency, catalytic activity and selectivity, and relatively low cost. In order to understand the structure–performance relationship and potential catalytic mechanism of Ru SACs, this review summarizes the research progress of Ru SACs in the fields of electrocatalytic water splitting, fuel cells, nitrogen reduction, and nitrate reduction in recent years. The catalytic process of Ru single atom in different synthesis methods and modification strategies is summarized. Finally, some opportunities and challenges for the future development of Ru SACs are prospected.","au":["Wenhua Chen","Min Yu","Suli Liu","Chunmei Zhang","Shaohua Jiang","Gaigai Duan"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"Ru 单原子催化剂的最新进展：合成、改性及能量应用","zb":"研究对象为 Ru 单原子催化剂 (SACs) 在电催化水分解、燃料电池、氮还原和硝酸盐还原等领域的应用。关键方法是总结不同合成方法和改性策略下 Ru 单原子的催化过程，并探讨其结构-性能关系和潜在催化机理。该综述展望了 Ru SACs 未来发展的机遇和挑战。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d3gc04432g","t":"Green ammonia synthesis from stationary NO x emission sources on a catalytic lean NO x trap","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d3gc04432g","s":"Green Chemistry","d":"2024-02-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The NOCCRA (NO x capture and catalytic reduction to ammonia) process enables local ammonia/fertiliser production out of NO x in the flue gas of stationary engines. The two-phase process adsorbs NO x on a lean NO x trap, followed by reduction to NH 3 by H 2 .","au":["Frea Van Steenweghen","Lander Hollevoet","Johan A. Martens"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"催化稀 NOx 捕获器上从固定源 NOx 制备绿色氨","zb":"NOCCRA 工艺利用两步法，先在稀 NOx 捕获器上吸附 NOx，随后用 H2 还原为 NH3，实现从发动机烟气中就地生产氨肥。"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.202301641","t":"Advancements in Single Atom Catalysts for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.202301641","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2024-02-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Due to the urgent demand for nitrate wastewater treatment, the quest for an efficient and environmentally friendly treatment method has emerged as a new research focus. The utilization of single‐atom catalysts (SACs) in electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) for ammonia production is presently recognized as an effective strategy to address pollution issues and obtain high value‐added products. In this review, we summarized the recent research advancements in NO 3 RR based on SACs. This review includes a comprehensive analysis of the identification and structural determination techniques for SACs, as well as the mechanism of NO 3 RR over SACs. Furthermore, this review investigates the impact of regulating single atom structures on NO 3 RR, providing valuable insights for enhancing reaction efficiency. It explores the application of in‐situ technology in real‐time m","au":["Lingyue Liu","Shourong Zheng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"电催化硝酸盐还原反应中单原子催化剂的进展","zb":"研究对象为单原子催化剂 (SACs) 在电催化硝酸盐还原反应 (NO 3 RR) 中用于氨生产的应用。关键方法是总结 SACs 的识别和结构测定技术，以及 SACs 上 NO 3 RR 的机理研究。该综述还探讨了调节单原子结构对 NO 3 RR 的影响，并研究了原位技术在实时监测和控制 NO 3 RR 中的应用。最后，提出了 SACs 在 NO 3 RR 中应用的展望和挑战。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.3c08087","t":"Ambient N 2 Reduction to NH 3 Electrocatalyzed by ZIF-67-Derived Nitrogen-Doped Porous Carbon Supported Co 9 S 8 Nanomaterials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.3c08087","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2024-02-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) under ambient conditions is a promising alternative to the Haber–Bosch process, but one of the primary pending issues for the eNRR is the development of efficient and stable electrocatalysts. Herein, we propose to prepare a ZIF-67-derived nitrogen-doped porous carbon-supported Co 9 S 8 nanocomposite achieving the maximum average of 9.80 μg h –1 mg cat –1 NH 3 yield and the highest Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 9.89% in 0.1 M Na 2 SO 4 . Moreover, Co 9 S 8 /NC shows excellent electrocatalytic stability and durability for the eNRR.","au":["Huanhuan Zhang","Shuhao Yan","Wei Yi","Xiao Ma","Jing He","Yebo Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"在环境条件下由 ZIF-67 衍生的氮掺杂多孔碳负载的 Co9S8 纳米材料电催化 N2 还原为 NH3","zb":"研究对象为电催化氮还原反应（eNRR），采用 ZIF-67 衍生的氮掺杂多孔碳负载的 Co9S8 纳米复合材料，在 0.1 M Na2SO4 电解液中实现了 9.80 μg h–1 mg cat–1 的 NH3 产率和 9.89% 的法拉第效率，Co9S8/NC 表现出优异的电催化稳定性和耐久性。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202315548","t":"Donor‐Site‐Acceptor Covalent Organic Frameworks Enable Spontaneous Nitrogen Dissociation for Boosted Photoelectrochemical Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202315548","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2024-02-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Photoelectrochemical (PEC) technology offers new opportunities for pushing the renewable energy‐driven ammonia synthesis toward a practical level, while still facing unsatisfactory efficiency due to the obstacle of dissociating inert nitrogen triple‐bonds. Herein, a novel donor‐site‐acceptor system is constructed in covalent organic frameworks to tackle this challenge for highly efficient PEC ammonia synthesis. Highly active boron site is elaborately embedded between the donor and acceptor units, which can be effectively activated with continuous electron flow upon photoexcitation. With the assistance of solar irradiation, the stubborn nitrogen dissociation is successfully changed from a passive endothermic reaction to a spontaneous exothermic process, completely eliminating the energy barrier of the rate‐determining step and facilitating the overall reaction kinetics. The proof","au":["Yanzheng He","Mengfan Wang","Lifang Zhang","Qiyang Cheng","Sisi Liu","Xing Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"供体-受体共价有机框架实现自发氮分解以提升光电化学氨合成性能","zb":"构建了供体-受体共价有机框架体系以解决氮三键惰性带来的挑战，通过在供体和受体单元之间精细嵌入高活性硼位点，在光激发下连续电子流可有效激活该位点。借助太阳光照射，顽固的氮分解成功从被动吸热反应转变为自发放热过程，完全消除了决速步骤的能量势垒，促进了整体反应动力学。该概念验证体系实现了优异的光电化学氮还原性能，法拉第效率达 91.6%，达到美国能源部设定的目标（90%）。","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-3779506/v1","t":"Boosting the cost competitiveness of low-carbon ammonia by expanding emission trading system coverage in China","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-3779506/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2024-02-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Transitioning to low-carbon ammonia is vital for China’s carbon neutrality goal; however, the economic viability of large-scale deployment remains uncertain. Here, we combined a prospective life-cycle assessment with an integrated assessment model to evaluate the impact of emission trading system (ETS) on the levelized cost of ammonia (LCOA) for six production technologies across 30 provinces in China between 2018 and 2060. Our results indicate that in the absence of ETS or with ETS coverage limited to the electricity grid, photovoltaic hydrogen-derived ammonia emerges as the only cost-competitive low-carbon option, projected to achieve cost parity with conventional ammonia by 2050 in 25 provinces. Expanding ETS coverage to the life cycle of ammonia production would accelerate the timeline of cost parity by 8-37 years across all 30 provinces. Northwestern China, which benefits f","au":["Dan Li","Jiashuo Li","Qianhui Sun","Fan Yang","Chen Wang","Kuishuang Feng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通过扩大中国碳排放交易体系覆盖范围提升低碳氨的成本竞争力","zb":"结合前瞻性生命周期评估与综合评估模型，评估了2018至2060年间中国30个省份六种生产技术的平准化氨成本。结果表明，扩大碳排放交易体系覆盖范围可加速成本平价时间8-37年。","pre":1},{"id":"10.15625/0868-3166/18878","t":"Effect of Precursor and Calcination Time on the Morphological Structure and Catalytic Activity of Co3O4 Film in the Oxygen Evolution Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.15625/0868-3166/18878","s":"Communications in Physics","d":"2024-02-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This research investigates the effect of cobalt precursor and calcination time on the morphology and catalytic activity of Co3O4 films in the oxygen evolution reaction (OER). Co3O4 films with porous flower-like nanostructures were obtained using cobalt nitrate as a cobalt precursor, while cobalt chlorides were used to produce porous nanoneedle structures Co3O4 film. Extended annealing time at temperatures 350°C caused structural fractures in the films. Among the samples, the synthesized Co3O4 films were then evaluated as catalyst materials for the OER in alkaline 1M KOH electrolyte. Among synthesized films, the Co3O4-2-1h, synthesized using the cobalt chlorides as Co precursor and annealed at 350°C for 1 hour, exhibited better OER catalytic activity. With its porous nanoneedle structure, the Co3O4-2-1h demonstrated superior performance comparable to the state-of-the-art 20% Ir/C catalyst","au":["Hoa Bui","Giang Nguyen Thi","Hanh Pham Hong","Tuyet Ngo Thi Anh","Linh Do","Lam Nguyen Duc"],"o":"回填","zt":"前驱体和煅烧时间对 Co3O4 薄膜在析氧反应中的形貌结构和催化活性的影响","zb":"研究钴前驱体和煅烧时间对 Co3O4 薄膜在析氧反应（OER）中的形貌和催化活性的影响，使用硝酸钴制备多孔花状纳米结构 Co3O4 薄膜，使用氯化钴制备多孔纳米针结构 Co3O4 薄膜，Co3O4-2-1h 薄膜在 350°C 煅烧 1 小时表现出最佳 OER 催化活性，其性能与 20% Ir/C 催化剂相当。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.3c03615","t":"Phase Diagram Analysis of High-Pressure/High-Temperature Polymorphs of Ammonia Borane","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.3c03615","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2024-02-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia borane (NH 3 BH 3 ) is a promising hydrogen-storage material because of its high hydrogen density. It is employed as a hydrogen source when synthesizing superconducting polyhydrides under high pressure. Additionally, NH 3 BH 3 is a crystallographically interesting compound that features protonic hydrogen (H δ+ ) and hydridic hydrogen (H δ− ), and it forms a dihydrogen bond, which explains its stable existence as a solid. Herein, X-ray diffraction experiments were performed at high pressures (HPs) and high temperatures (HTs) of up to 30 GPa and 300 °C, respectively, to investigate the HP/HT phase diagram of NH 3 BH 3 . A new HP/HT phase (HPHT2) was identified above 9 GPa and 150 °C. Crystal-structure analysis using the Rietveld method and stability verification using density functional theory calculations revealed that HPHT2 has a P 2 1 / n ( Z = 4) structure, similar to that of a","au":["Satoshi Nakano","Hiroshi Fujihisa","Hiroshi Yamawaki","Takumi Kikegawa"],"o":"回填","zt":"氨硼烷高压/高温多态相图分析","zb":"通过高压（高达 30 GPa）和高温（高达 300 °C）的 X 射线衍射实验研究 NH3BH3 的 HP/HT 相图，在 9 GPa 和 150 °C 以上识别出一种新的 HP/HT 相 (HPHT2)，其结构为 P21/n (Z = 4)，与在较低压力下出现的 HP/HT 相相似，但密度更高。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.1007/s44211-023-00503-5","t":"Nitrogen K-edge X-ray adsorption near-edge structure spectroscopy of chemically adsorbed ammonia gas on clay minerals and the 15N/14N-nitrogen isotopic fractionation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s44211-023-00503-5","s":"Analytical Sciences","d":"2024-02-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH 3 ) is a simple and essential nitrogen carrier in the universe. Its adsorption on mineral surfaces is an important step in the synthesis of nitrogenous organic molecules in extraterrestrial environments. The nitrogen isotopic ratios provide a useful tool for understanding the formation processes of N-bearing molecules. In this study, adsorption experiments were conducted using gaseous NH 3 and representative clay minerals. The strongly adsorbed NH 3 was 15 N-enriched in a state of chemical equilibrium between the adsorption and desorption on the siliceous host surface. The nitrogen K-edge X-ray adsorption near-edge structure spectroscopy study revealed that these initial ammonia gases were chemically adsorbed as ammonium ions (NH 4 + ) on clay minerals. Graphical abstract","au":["Haruna Sugahara","Toshihiro Yoshimura","Yusuke Tamenori","Yoshinori Takano","Nanako O. Ogawa","Yoshito Chikaraishi"],"o":"回填","zt":"氮 K 边 X 射线吸附近边结构光谱研究化学吸附的氨气在粘土矿物上的吸附和 15N/14N 氮同位素分馏","zb":"通过吸附实验研究气态 NH3 在代表性粘土矿物上的吸附，发现强吸附的 NH3 在吸附和脱附的化学平衡状态下富集 15N，X 射线吸附近边结构光谱研究表明初始氨气以铵根离子 (NH4+) 的形式化学吸附在粘土矿物上。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨"},{"id":"10.1002/advs.202304046","t":"Precise Design of TiO 2 @CoO x Heterostructure via Atomic Layer Deposition for Synergistic Sono‐Chemodynamic Oncotherapy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.202304046","s":"Advanced Science","d":"2024-02-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Sonodynamic therapy (SDT), a tumor treatment modality with high tissue penetration and low side effects, is able to selectively kill tumor cells by producing cytotoxic reactive oxygen species (ROS) with ultrasound‐triggered sonosensitizers. N‐type inorganic semiconductor TiO 2 has low ROS quantum yields under ultrasound irradiation and inadequate anti‐tumor activity. Herein, by using atomic layer deposition (ALD) to create a heterojunction between porous TiO 2 and CoO x , the sonodynamic therapy efficiency of TiO 2 can be improved. Compared to conventional techniques, the high controllability of ALD allows for the delicate loading of CoO x nanoparticles into TiO 2 pores, resulting in the precise tuning of the interfaces and energy band structures and ultimately optimal SDT properties. In addition, CoO x exhibits a cascade of H 2 O 2 →O 2 →·O 2 − in response to the tumor microenv","au":["Wen Liu","Runrun Shao","Lingyun Guo","Jianliang Man","Chengwu Zhang","Lihong Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积精确设计的TiO2@CoO异质结构用于协同超声化学动力学肿瘤治疗","zb":"超声动力学治疗（SDT）是一种具有高组织穿透性和低副作用的肿瘤治疗方法，通过超声触发的声敏剂产生细胞毒性活性氧（ROS）选择性杀死肿瘤细胞。N型无机半导体TiO2在超声照射下ROS量子产率低，抗肿瘤活性不足。本研究利用原子层沉积（ALD）在多孔TiO2和CoOx之间构建异质结，提高了TiO2的SDT效率。与常规技术相比，ALD的高可控性允许将CoOx纳米颗粒精细地负载到TiO2孔隙中，从而精确调节界面和能带结构，最终实现最佳的SDT性能。此外，CoOx在肿瘤微环境中表现出H2O2→O2→·O2−的级联反应，不仅缓解了SDT过程中的缺氧，还促进了化学动力学治疗（CDT）的效果。相应的协同CDT/SDT治疗成功抑制了肿瘤生长。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.15541/jim20230433","t":"Mo/S Co-doped Graphene for Ammonia Synthesis: a Density Functional Theory Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.15541/jim20230433","s":"Journal of Inorganic Materials","d":"2024-02-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In the industrial landscape, the well-established Haber-Bosch method is employed for the catalytic synthesis of ammonia (NH3) from hydrogen and nitrogen gases, necessitating elevated temperatures (400-600 °C ) and high pressures (150-300 atm).In response to the imperative to reduce energy consumption and environment impact imposed by this synthetic process, significant research efforts have converged on realizing NH3 synthesis under ambient conditions.This study delves into the realm of N2 electrocatalytic reduction to NH3, using density functional theory (DFT) calculations to explore the feasibility of employing graphene co-doped with a combination of transition metal elements (e.g., Fe, Nb, Mo, W, Ru) and non-metal elements (e.g., B, P, S) as catalysts for ammonia synthesis.The findings underscore that Mo and S co-doped graphene (Mo/S graphene) demonstrates an exceptionally low electro","au":["Honglan LI","Junmiao ZHANG","Erhong SONG","Xinglin YANG"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"用于氨合成的 Mo/S 共掺杂石墨烯：密度泛函理论研究","zb":"研究对象为氨合成（NH3）催化剂，采用密度泛函理论（DFT）计算方法，研究Mo和S共掺杂石墨烯（Mo/S graphene）的催化性能。结果显示Mo/S共掺杂石墨烯在氨合成中具有极低的电极电位0.47 V，关键速率控制步骤为NNH中间体的形成。该材料在室温下表现出优异的热力学稳定性，过渡金属的电子通信能力和非金属元素对过渡金属配位环境的影响对催化效率起关键作用。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzg2NDg1ODEwNQ==&mid=2247499053&idx=4","t":"中科院大连化物所：氢化锂介导光化学合成氨新技术","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2NDg1ODEwNQ%3D%3D&mid=2247499053&idx=4","s":"新能源技术与装备","d":"2024-02-02","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"近日，中国科学院大连化学物理研究所研究员陈萍、郭建平团队在氢化物化学固氮研究方面取得新进展。团队揭示了氢化锂（LiH）光致脱氢变色现象与固氮之间的关联，并由此构筑了氢化锂介导的光催化合成氨过程。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzIwNjA2MjIyOA==&mid=2650278506&idx=1","t":"Nature Chemistry | 大连化物所青促会会员实现氢化锂介导光化学合成氨","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwNjA2MjIyOA%3D%3D&mid=2650278506&idx=1","s":"中国科学院青年创新促进会","d":"2024-02-02","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"并由此构筑了lih介导的光催化合成氨过程。氮气加氢合成氨是维持地球上生命延续、满足人类社会对能源与化工需求的关键化学反应之一。然而，现有Haber-Bosch合成氨技术需要高温高压的苛刻反应条件（>400C，>100 bar），是一个高","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"ob":"光驱动","wx":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202308182","t":"Boosting Electrochemical Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia by Constructing Nitrate‐Favored Active Cu–B Sites on SnS 2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202308182","s":"Small","d":"2024-02-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia is an effective method for mitigating nitrate pollution and generating ammonia. To design superior electrocatalysts, it is essential to construct a reaction site with high activity. Herein, a simple two‐step method is applied to in situ reduce amorphous copper over boron‐doped SnS 2 nanosheets(denoted as aCu@B–SnS 2‐x . DFT calculations reveal the combination of amorphous copper and B‐doping strategy can construct Cu–B active twins and introduce sulfur vacancies on the surface of the inert SnS 2 , the active twins can efficiently adsorb nitrate and forcibly separate oxygen atoms from nitrate under the assistance of the exposed Sn atom, leading to strong nitrate adsorption. Benefiting from this, aCu@B–SnS 2‐x exhibited an ultrahigh NH 3 FE of 94.6% at −0.67 V versus RHE and the highest NH 3 yield rate of 0.55 mmol h −1 mg −1 cat","au":["Heen Li","Yuanzhe Wang","Shuheng Chen","Fei Peng","Faming Gao"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate to Ammonia"],"zt":"通过在 SnS2 上构建硝酸根优先的 Cu-B 活性位点提升硝酸盐电化学还原为氨的性能","zb":"采用简单两步法原位还原无定形铜在硼掺杂 SnS2 纳米片上（记为 aCu@B–SnS2–x），DFT 计算揭示无定形铜与 B 掺杂策略可构建 Cu-B 活性孪晶并在惰性 SnS2 表面引入硫空位，活性孪晶可有效吸附硝酸根并在暴露 Sn 原子协助下强制分离硝酸根中的氧原子，导致强硝酸根吸附。因此，aCu@B–SnS2–x 在碱性条件下表现出超高的 NH3 法拉第效率（94.6%）和最高的 NH3 产率（0.55 mmol h−1 mg −1 cat (9350 µg h −1 mg −1 cat )），且经各种稳定性测试后仍保持活性，表明其在工业应用中的可行性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.3c07388","t":"Electroreduction of Nitrite to Ammonia over a Cobalt Single-Atom Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.3c07388","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2024-02-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrite-to-ammonia reduction (NO 2 RR) holds great promise for converting harmful NO 2 – into valuable NH 3 . Herein, we develop Co single atoms dispersed on a C 3 N 4 substrate (Co 1 /C 3 N 4 ) as an efficient catalyst toward the NO 2 RR. Experimental and theoretical investigations reveal that single-atom Co sites can effectively active NO 2 – and optimize the formation energy of the key *NOH intermediate to promote the NO 2 – → NH 3 energetics. Remarkably, Co 1 /C 3 N 4 equipped in a flow cell delivers the exceptional NH 3 –Faradaic efficiency of 97.9% and NH 3 yield rate of 1080.3 μmol h –1 cm –2 at an industrial-level current density of 355 mA cm –2, along with a long-term durability of 100 h of electrolysis, showing the considerable potential for practical NH 3 electrosynthesis.","au":["Hongyan Zhao","Jiaqi Xiang","Zeyi Sun","Shiyao Shang","Ke Chu"],"o":"回填","zt":"在钴单原子催化剂上硝酸盐电化学还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐到氨的还原（NO2RR）催化剂，制备了分散在C3N4载体上的钴单原子催化剂（Co1/C3N4）。实验和理论研究表明，钴单原子位点能有效活化NO2-并优化关键中间体*NOH的形成能，促进NO2-到NH3的能量转换。在工业级电流密度355 mA cm-2下，Co1/C3N4在流动电池中表现出97.9%的氨法拉第效率和1080.3 μmol h-1 cm-2的氨产率，电解稳定性达100小时。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d3ey00301a","t":"Revisiting group 4–7 transition metals for heterogeneous ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d3ey00301a","s":"EES Catalysis","d":"2024-02-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":36,"ab":"Group 4–7 metals are usually inactive for NH 3 synthesis catalysis and have gained far less attention as compared to Fe and Ru. This mini-review discusses potential strategies to activate these metals, aiming to find novel catalysts for NH 3 synthesis.","au":["Wenbo Gao","Yawei Wang","Qianru Wang","Zhaolong Sun","Jianping Guo","Ping Chen"],"o":"回填","w":["Ping Chen"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"重新审视用于氨合成的第 4–7 族过渡金属","zb":"综述了第 4–7 族过渡金属在氨合成中的潜在活化策略，旨在寻找除 Fe 和 Ru 以外的全新催化剂。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1107/s1600576723011020","t":"The RAPTR furnace: a rapid heating and cooling sample furnace for in situ X-ray scattering studies of temperature-induced reactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1107/s1600576723011020","s":"Journal of Applied Crystallography","d":"2024-02-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"In situ X-ray scattering provides valuable insights into the mechanisms and kinetics of reactions and structural transformations. For reactions and structural transformations primarily driven by temperature, and not coupled to chemical/electrochemical triggers, our ability to initiate and quench processes thermally is a practical limit for probing fast reactive phenomena. Meaningful quantitative analysis requires the dynamic phenomena to be triggered on fast time scales relative to the reaction/transformation kinetics. This article describes a new sample furnace, the Rapid-Actuating Pneumatic Thermal Reactor or RAPTR, for time-resolved in situ X-ray scattering studies initiated by temperature. The RAPTR quickly heats and cools samples by translating them into and out of a pre-heated hot zone. Using diffraction thermometry, it is shown that the samples can be heated/cooled in 10 s or less","au":["Danrui Hu","Michelle L. Beauvais","Bryce G. Mullens","Bryan A. Sanchez Monserrate","Simon M. Vornholt","Gabrielle E. Kamm"],"o":"回填","why":["rapid heating"],"zt":"RAPTR炉：快速加热和冷却样品炉用于温度诱导反应的原位X射线散射研究","zb":"原位X射线散射可提供有关反应机制和动力学的宝贵见解。对于主要由温度驱动的反应和结构转变，而与化学/电化学触发无关的情况，我们通过热触发过程的能力是探测快速反应现象的实用限制。有意义的定量分析要求动态现象在反应/转变动力学的时间尺度上被触发。本文描述了一种新的样品炉RAPTR（快速气动热反应器），用于温度触发的原位X射线散射研究。RAPTR通过将样品移入和移出预热的加热区来快速加热和冷却样品。使用衍射热测量法表明，样品可在10秒或更短时间内加热/冷却，可达~1000°C的温度。RAPTR炉的应用通过探索快速固态反应得到了证明：从PbO和WO3合成 scheelite-type 钨铅矿 PbWO4，其中Pb3WO6被确定为一种以前未识别的反应中间体。","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzIyNDA1MjExMQ==&mid=2650159072&idx=1","t":"中国科学院大连化物所陈萍&郭建平研究团队：氢化锂介导光化学合成氨","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyNDA1MjExMQ%3D%3D&mid=2650159072&idx=1","s":"果壳硬科技","d":"2024-02-01","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"并由此构筑了LiH介导的光催化合成氨过程。陈萍团队自2009年起致力于氢化物固氮化学研究，先后发展了过渡金属-氢化物催化合成氨（Nature Chemistry， 2017， 9， 64），氢化物介导化学链合成氨（Nature Energy， 2018， 3， 1067），以及","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨｜光驱动","wx":1},{"id":"10.1063/1674-0068/cjcp2305043","t":"Theoretical investigations of electrochemical nitrogen reduction on single transition metal atom catalysts supported by 1T-MoSe2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1063/1674-0068/cjcp2305043","s":"Chinese Journal of Chemical Physics","d":"2024-02-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The search for stable and efficient single-atom catalysts (SACs) for the electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) has garnered significant theoretical interest. In this study, we evaluate the eNRR performance of eighteen two-dimensional 1T-MoSe2-supported transition metal single-atom catalysts (TM@1T-MoSe2, TM=V, Cr, Mn, Fe, Co, Ni, Nb, Mo, Tc, Ru, Rh, Pd, Ta, W, Re, Os, Ir, and Pt) using density functional theory calculations. We assess the stability of each TM@1T-MoSe2, as well as the limiting potential of eNRR and the ammonia selectivity on each stable TM@1T-MoSe2. Our results show that W@1T-MoSe2 is the most promising single-atom catalyst for eNRR, with a limiting potential of -0.23 V via the distal pathway starting from three co-adsorbed nitrogen molecules. Furthermore, the multi-adsorption of N2 on W@1T-MoSe2 effectively suppress the hydrogen evolution reaction, thus enh","au":["A-Qiang Sun","Mingxin Qin","ShaoTong Zhu","Ying Zhou","Zhiqiang Bai","Wenhua Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在1T-MoSe2载体上单过渡金属原子催化剂电化学氮还原的理论研究","zb":"研究对象为电化学氮还原反应（eNRR）催化剂，采用密度泛函理论计算评估了18种二维1T-MoSe2载体上的过渡金属单原子催化剂（TM@1T-MoSe2）的性能。结果显示W@1T-MoSe2是最有前景的单原子催化剂，极限电位为-0.23 V，通过从三个共吸附氮分子开始的远程路径。N2的多吸附有效抑制了析氢反应，提高了eNRR的选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s12274-024-6450-7","t":"Ru-Ni alloy nanosheets as tandem catalysts for electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s12274-024-6450-7","s":"Nano Research","d":"2024-02-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Developing electrocatalysts that exhibit both high activity and ammonia selectivity for nitrate reduction is a significant and demanding challenge, primarily due to the complex nature of the multiple-electron reduction process involved. An encouraging approach involves coupling highly active precious metals with transition metals to enhance catalytic performance through synergy. Here, we report a ruthenium-nickel alloy catalyst with nanosheets (Ru-Ni NSs) structure that achieves a remarkable ammonia Faradaic efficiency of approximately 95.93%, alongside a yield rate of up to 6.11 g·h −1 ·cm −2 . Moreover, the prepared Ru-Ni NSs exhibit exceptional stability during continuous nitrate reduction in a flow reactor for 100 h, maintaining a Faradaic efficiency of approximately 90% and an ammonia yield of 37.4 mg·L −1 ·h −1 using 0.05 M nitrate alkaline electrolyte. Mechanistic studies reveal t","au":["Xingchao You","Jiawei Xu","Zechao Zhuang","Junkai Xia","Suwen Wang","Haiyan Wei"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"Ru-Ni合金纳米片作为串联催化剂用于硝酸盐电化学还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐还原为氨的催化剂，制备了Ru-Ni合金纳米片（Ru-Ni NSs）结构催化剂。该催化剂在流动反应器中连续硝酸盐还原100小时，氨法拉第效率保持约95.93%，氨产率高达6.11 g·h-1·cm-2。机理研究表明，催化过程遵循两步路径，HONO作为迁移中间体。部分氧化的Ru (002)表面增强硝酸盐吸附并促进迁移中间体的释放，Ni (111)表面促进迁移中间体利用并降低氨脱附能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d4dt00043a","t":"Electrocatalytic reduction of nitrite to ammonia on undercoordinated Cu","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4dt00043a","s":"Dalton Transactions","d":"2024-02-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Undercoordinated Cu nanowires are explored as an efficient catalyst for NO 2 − electroreduction to NH 3 , arising from the created undercoordinated Cu sites to promote NO 2 − -to-NH 3 energetics.","au":["Ruichao Zhang","Shiyao Shang","Fuzhou Wang","Ke Chu"],"o":"回填","zt":"在次配位Cu上硝酸盐电化学还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐到氨的还原（NO2-电化学还原）催化剂，探索了次配位Cu纳米线作为高效催化剂。次配位的Cu位点促进了NO2-到NH3的能量转换。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2024.113841","t":"Unraveling the mechanism of modulating external electric fields for regulating nitrogen fixation and activation on three-atom metal clusters","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2024.113841","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Qihang Li","She Chen","Yuting Tang","Xingyi Chen","Yunjie Li","Kelin Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"揭示调控外加电场调节三原子金属簇上氮固定与活化的机理","ob":"电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcou.2024.102699","t":"Toward green ammonia synthesis – exploring the influence of lanthanide oxides as supports on the cobalt catalysts properties","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcou.2024.102699","s":"Journal of CO2 Utilization","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Nowadays, ammonia is viewed as the prospective green hydrogen fuel carrier. Yet, there still is a demand for active, energy-efficient NH3 synthesis catalysts to make ammonia use economically viable. This paper studies and discusses lanthanide oxide-supported cobalt catalysts for low-pressure ammonia synthesis, which are intended to be a model for prototyping systems alternative to ruthenium-based catalysts. In the Co/Ln2O3 system, lanthanide oxide is a support and an electronic promoter. The electron density on the active phase’s surface is increased through Strong Metal-Support Interactions and the formation of oxygen-deficient, Ln2O3−x species capable of electron donation. In the systems, electronic promotion strength depends on the Ln3+ cation and the support conductivity, catalyst Turnover Frequency and basicity increase exponentially with the increase of the Ln3+ ionic radius. These","au":["Wojciech Patkowski","Magdalena Zybert","Hubert Ronduda","Aleksander Albrecht","Dariusz Moszyński","Aleksandra Fidler"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"迈向绿色氨合成——探索镧系氧化物作为载体对钴催化剂性能的影响","zb":"研究镧系氧化物负载钴催化剂在低压氨合成中的应用，利用强金属-载体相互作用和氧缺位物种提高活性相表面电子密度。结果表明，催化剂的周转频率和碱性随Ln3+离子半径增大呈指数增长，为设计新型钴催化剂提供了依据。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2023.12.162","t":"Simultaneous degradation of SMX for efficient nitrogen fixation to ammonia and hydrogen evolution using AgVO3@rGO-Ag3PO4 (110) heterojunction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2023.12.162","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Xueyu Wei","Saraschandra Naraginti","Xiaofan Yang","Xiaoping Xu","Jiyuan Li","Meiqing Zhu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"利用 AgVO3@rGO-Ag3PO4 (110) 异质结同时降解 SMX 以高效固氮产氨和产氢","ob":"析氢反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2023.129858","t":"Beyond equilibrium ammonia synthesis in a membrane and heat exchange integrated microreactor: A modeling study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2023.129858","s":"Fuel","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Emre Kucuk","H. Hasan Koybasi","Ahmet K. Avci"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"膜与换热集成微反应器中超越平衡的氨合成：建模研究","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.vacuum.2023.112843","t":"Atomic layer deposited RuO2 with controlled crystallinity and thickness for oxygen evolution reaction catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.vacuum.2023.112843","s":"Vacuum","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Jaehwan Lee","Sanghun Lee","Youngjun Kim","Yongju Kwon","Woo-Hee Kim","Seung-min Chung"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积具有可控结晶度和厚度的 RuO2 用于析氧反应催化","ob":"通用催化方法","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2023.125393","t":"Rapid Joule heating synthesis of Pt clusters on C3N4 with abundant nitrogen vacancies for highly-efficiently photocatalytic H2 production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2023.125393","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Zehui Zhao","Guangmin Ren","Zisheng Zhang","Xiangchao Meng","Zizhen Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"快速焦热合成氮空位丰富的 C3N4 上 Pt 簇用于高效光催化制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mseb.2023.117085","t":"Rapid preparation of nanoporous copper by transient joule heating vapor phase dealloying","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mseb.2023.117085","s":"Materials Science and Engineering: B","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Bao Lin","Yuhao Wang","Xiaoshi Hu","Wen Zhang","Haiying Qin"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"瞬态焦热蒸发脱合金快速制备纳米多孔铜","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.colsurfa.2023.132900","t":"Rapid preparation of porous carbon by Flash Joule heating from bituminous coal and its adsorption mechanism of methylene blue","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfa.2023.132900","s":"Colloids and Surfaces A: Physicochemical and Engineering Aspects","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Qiang Li","Yajun Wang","Rongtao Zhu","Junchen Wu","Wenjun Zhang","Haozhi Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪焦热快速制备多孔碳及其亚甲基蓝吸附机理","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2023.147988","t":"Flash Joule heating induced highly defective graphene towards ultrahigh lithium ion storage","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2023.147988","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Shu Dong","Yali Song","Mingyu Su","Guiling Wang","Yingyi Gao","Kai Zhu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪焦热诱导高缺陷石墨烯用于超高锂离子存储","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.carbon.2024.118826","t":"Joule-heating electrospun reduced-graphene oxide nanoribbon-coated reusable polymeric sorbent with an excellent sorption/desorption of high-viscosity oils","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.carbon.2024.118826","s":"Carbon","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Siyoung Byun","Seongjik Park","Eui-jong Lee","Alicia Kyoungjin An","Sanghyun Jeong"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"焦耳热电纺还原石墨烯氧化物纳米带涂层可重复使用的聚合物吸附剂具有优异的高粘度油吸附/解吸性能","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jenvman.2023.119877","t":"Discordance between farmers and scientists - Perspectives on nitrogen reduction measures in Denmark","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jenvman.2023.119877","s":"Journal of Environmental Management","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Mitigating nitrogen leaching from agricultural land is imperative for enhancing the ecological status of aquatic ecosystems. Incorporating the knowledge and perceptions of farmers regarding the feasibility and effectiveness of implementing nitrogen reduction measures is vital for increasing the adoption rate of such measures and related policies. Concurrently, the insights and perspectives of scientists advising policymakers on the implementation of these measures can facilitate a more comprehensive understanding of the barriers and potential for implementation. In this study, we employ Q methodology to elucidate the opinions of 11 farmers and 14 key scientists involved in providing contractual science policy advice to Danish ministries on nitrogen reduction measures. Results show that across the perspectives of farmers and scientists, four main factors (viewpoints) can be identified: 'E","au":["Sara V. Iversen","Tommy Dalgaard","Morten Graversgaard"],"o":"回填","zt":"农民与科学家之间的分歧 - 丹麦氮减排措施的视角","zb":"本研究采用 Q 方法，阐述了 11 位农民和 14 位参与丹麦氮减排政策咨询的科学家对氮减排措施的可行性和有效性的看法。结果表明，农民和科学家之间存在普遍的广泛分歧和相反的视角，科学家普遍认为景观和长期措施（尤其是湿地）最有效，而一些农民则强烈认为应增加个人自由和灵活性进行农场层面的管理选择。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2024.148811","t":"Visible-Light-Induced photocatalytic oxidation of gaseous ammonia on Mo, c-codoped TiO2: Synthesis, performance and mechanism","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2024.148811","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yanxu Wang","Lijia Huang","Tian C. Zhang","Yan Wang","Shaojun Yuan"],"o":"回填","zt":"Mo, c-codoped TiO2 可见光诱导气态氨的光催化氧化：合成、性能与机理","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202470020","t":"An In situ Proton Filter Covalent Organic Framework Catalyst for Highly Efficient Aqueous Electrochemical Ammonia Production (Adv. Energy Mater. 5/2024)","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202470020","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Electrochemical Ammonia Production In article number 2303068, Tharamani C. Nagaiah, Dinesh Shetty, and co-workers developed a covalent organic framework (COF) catalyst (Ru-Tta-Dfp) with built-in N2 reduction sites and in-situ proton filter ability to control N2 and proton flux for extremely efficient nitrogen reduction reaction catalysis. A remarkable ammonia production yield rate of 2.03 mg h−1 mgcat−1 and excellent Faradaic efficiency of 52.9% is achieved. This work offers prospects for the development of COF-based efficient NRR catalysts.","au":["Kayaramkodath C. Ranjeesh","Sukhjot Kaur","Abdul K. Mohammed","Safa Gaber","Divyani Gupta","Khaled Badawy"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"一种原位质子过滤器共价有机框架催化剂用于高效水相电化学氨合成 (Adv. Energy Mater. 5/2024)","zb":"研究对象为共价有机框架催化剂 (COF) (Ru-Tta-Dfp)，关键方法为构建内置 N2 还原位点和原位质子过滤器能力以控制 N2 和质子通量，主要结果为氨生产产率 2.03 mg h−1 mgcat−1 和法拉第效率 52.9%。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2023.125357","t":"Nitrate reduction to ammonia in Fe/Fe2+ system: A case study on the mechanism of green rust generation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2023.125357","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Huiming Xiang","Weiye Liu","Lianghu Su","Sujuan Chen","Yu Han","Chunyuan Zhu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate reduction"],"zt":"在 Fe/Fe2+ 体系中硝酸盐还原为氨：绿色锈生成机理的案例研究","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2023.125304","t":"Boosting nitrogen adsorption for photocatalytic ammonia production via tuning electron distribution using zero valent iron as medium","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2023.125304","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Huici Qiao","Yu Han","Runxian Hao","Lianjie Xu","Jun Ma","Bin Wen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通过使用零价铁作为介质调节电子分布来提高氮吸附用于光催化氨生产","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.renene.2023.119707","t":"A novel solar system for photothermal-assisted electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.renene.2023.119707","s":"Renewable Energy","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Haiyang Xu","Le Zhang","ShengJie Wei","Xuan Tong","Yue Yang","Xu Ji"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"一个用于光热辅助电催化硝酸盐还原反应制备氨的新太阳能系统","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2024.113879","t":"First-principles screening of Cu-based single-atom alloys for highly efficient electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2024.113879","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Denglei Gao","Ding Yi","Jing Xia","Yongan Yang","Xi Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"基于Cu的单一原子合金的第一性原理筛选以实现高效的电催化氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2024.111871","t":"Interfacial MoO2 nanograins assembled over graphitic carbon nanofibers boosting efficient electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2024.111871","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xiu Zhong","Xinping Wu","Yang Liu","Shiqi Yang","Haodong Li","Qian Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"在石墨碳纳米纤维上组装的MoO2纳米颗粒增强有效的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2023.11.082","t":"Strong electron coupling of FeP4/Ni2P to boost highly-efficient electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2023.11.082","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical reduction of contaminated nitrate to ammonia (NRA) opens a new window for mass production of ammonia and the alleviation of energy crises and environmental pollution. However, fabricating effective catalysts for the NRA still faces significant challenges. Herein, a highly-efficient NRA catalyst, FeP 4 /Ni 2 P, was successfully constructed. The strong electron coupling at heterointerfaces of FeP 4 /Ni 2 P promoted the generation of abundant active hydrogen *H, inhibited the competition of the HER, accelerated the hydrogenation of the NRA. Benefiting from these, the catalyst displays good NRA catalytic activity in the neutral electrolyte, with the NH 3 FE of 97.83 ± 0.091 %, NH 3 selectivity of 98.67 ± 0.50 %, NH 3 yield rate of 0.262 ± 0.01 mmol·h -1 ·cm -2 , and NO 3 - conversion rate of 93.02 ± 0.14 %. The DFT theoretical calculations demonstrated that the FeP 4 /Ni 2 P ","au":["Shengmei Lv","Fenglin Gou","Qiao Gou","Yini Mao","Hua Wang","Yimin Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"FeP4/Ni2P的强电子耦合增强高效的电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"FeP4/Ni2P是一种高效的硝酸盐还原为氨(NRA)催化剂。FeP4/Ni2P异质界面处的强电子耦合促进了丰富的活性氢*H的产生，抑制了析氢反应(HER)的竞争，加速了NRA的加氢。在中性电解质中，该催化剂表现出良好的NRA催化活性，氨(NH3)法拉第效率为97.83 ± 0.091 %，氨(NH3)选择性的98.67 ± 0.50 %，氨(NH3)产率为0.262 ± 0.01 mmol·h -1 ·cm -2 ，硝酸根(NO3-)转化率为93.02 ± 0.14 %。DFT理论计算表明，FeP4/Ni2P异质界面在剪切水的H-OH键中起关键作用，产生更多的活性氢作为NRA加氢的关键来源，并阻碍*H二聚化形成H2，提高氨(NH3)选择性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2023.11.265","t":"Tuning transition metal atoms embedded in N6 cavity structure toward efficient electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2023.11.265","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Rong Cao","Jiezhen Xia","Qi Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在N6空腔结构中嵌入过渡金属原子以实现高效的电催化氨合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2023.130243","t":"Modeling and multi-objective optimization of electrified ammonia decomposition: Improvement of performance and thermal behavior","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2023.130243","s":"Fuel","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ali Cherif","Mohammadamin Zarei","Joo-Sung Lee","Ha-Jun Yoon","Chul-Jin Lee"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"电化学氨分解的建模和多目标优化：性能和热行为的改善","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2023.130176","t":"Ammonia decomposition for carbon-free hydrogen production over Ni/Al-Ce catalysts: Synergistic effect between Al and Ce","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2023.130176","s":"Fuel","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yangfeng Li","Wenshuo Zhang","Jie Ren","Weili Zhou","Zhandong Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"在 Ni/Al-Ce 催化剂上氨分解制备无碳氢气：Al 和 Ce 之间的协同效应","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.electacta.2023.143680","t":"Enhancing electrochemical N2 reduction at mild conditions with FexOy co-deposited on amorphous MoS2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2023.143680","s":"Electrochimica Acta","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Caio V.S. Almeida","Lucia H. Mascaro"],"o":"回填","why":["N2 reduction"],"zt":"在温和条件下使用 FexOy 共沉积在非晶态 MoS2 上增强电化学 N2 还原","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.chemosphere.2024.141182","t":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction over bimetallic Pd–Sn nanocatalysts with tunable selectivity toward benign nitrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chemosphere.2024.141182","s":"Chemosphere","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Nitrate is recognized as a highly impactful water contaminant among various pollutants in water. To address the ever-growing demand for water purification, this work investigates the bimetallic palladium (Pd) and tin (Sn) catalysts, which are electrochemically deposited on stainless steel mesh support (Pd-Sn/SS) for the selective conversion of harmful nitrate (NO 3 - ) into benign nitrogen (N 2 ) gas. Results indicate that the bimetallic composition in Pd-Sn/SS electrodes substantially influenced the reaction route for nitrate reduction as well as the performance of nitrate transformation and nitrogen selectivity. It is found that the electrode prepared from Pd:Sn = 1:1 (mole ratio) demonstrates an outstanding nitrate conversion of 95%, nitrogen selectivity of 88%, and nitrogen yield of 82%, which outperform many reported values in the literature. The electrochemically synthesized bimeta","au":["Jenn Fang Su","Muhammad Sheraz Ahmad","Wei-Fan Kuan","Ching-Lung Chen","Tahir Rasheed"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"在具有可调选择性的双金属Pd–Sn纳米催化剂上电化学硝酸盐还原为有益氮","zb":"研究双金属钯（Pd）和锡（Sn）催化剂，电化学沉积在不锈钢丝网载体（Pd-Sn/SS）上，用于将有害硝酸盐（NO 3 - ）选择性转化为有益氮（N 2 ）气体。结果显示，Pd-Sn/SS电极中的双金属组成显著影响了硝酸盐还原的反应路径以及硝酸盐转化性能和氮选择性。Pd:Sn=1:1（摩尔比）制备的电极表现出95%的硝酸盐转化率、88%的氮选择性和82%的氮产率，优于文献中许多报道值。电化学合成的双金属电极为此提供了新的见解，以促进水中硝酸盐还原的反应性和选择性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2024.148883","t":"Deficient Tin oxide nanofibers with regulated valence for efficient nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2024.148883","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Kaihe Wang","Jiaqi Pan","Jiachong Hu","Xingyue Fu","Yao Dou","Haohong Xian"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"具有调节价态的缺位锡氧化物纳米纤维使硝酸盐高效还原为氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2024.148857","t":"Ti3+ redox dynamics enabling efficient nitrate reduction to ammonia on Ti2O3","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2024.148857","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ying Chen","Chengli Yang","Haobo Li","Ziyu Ma","Donghai Wu","Yongchao Yao"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"Ti3+氧化还原动力学使Ti2O3上硝酸盐高效还原为氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2024.148596","t":"Conductive polymer protection strategy to promote electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia in highly acidic condition over Cu-based catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2024.148596","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Haotong Chen","Zhiyuan Zhang","Yan Li","Lili Yu","Fei Chen","Li Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"导电聚合物保护策略促进在强酸性条件下Cu基催化剂上电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cclet.2023.108341","t":"Enhancing the electrocatalytic performance of nitrate reduction to ammonia by in-situ nitrogen leaching","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cclet.2023.108341","s":"Chinese Chemical Letters","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mimi Fu","Yini Mao","Hua Wang","Wei Luo","Yimin Jiang","Wei Shen"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过原位氮浸出增强硝酸盐还原为氨的电催化性能","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.biortech.2023.130184","t":"Nitrogen removal characteristics of novel bacterium Klebsiella sp. TSH15 by assimilatory/dissimilatory nitrate reduction and ammonia assimilation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2023.130184","s":"Bioresource Technology","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A novel strain with heterotrophic nitrification and aerobic denitrification was screened and identified as Klebsiella sp. TSH15 by 16S rRNA. The results demonstrated that the ammonia-N and nitrate-N removal rates were 2.99 mg/L/h and 2.53 mg/L/h under optimal conditions, respectively. The analysis of the whole genome indicated that strain TSH15 contained the key genes involved in assimilatory/dissimilatory nitrate reduction and ammonia assimilation, including nas, nar, nir, nor, glnA, gltB, gdhA, and amt. The relative expression levels of key nitrogen removal genes were further detected by RT-qPCR. The results indicated that the N metabolic pathways of strain TSH15 were the conversion of nitrate or nitrite to ammonia by assimilatory/dissimilatory nitrate reduction (NO 3 - →NO 2 - →NH 4 + ) and further conversion of ammonia to glutamate (NH 4 + -N → Glutamate) by ammonia assimilation. The","au":["Jilong Ren","Jiajun Tang","Hongping Min","Dingding Tang","Rui Jiang","Yanchen Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"新型细菌 Klebsiella sp. TSH15 通过同化/异化硝酸盐还原和氨同化去除氮的特性","zb":"研究对象为新型菌株 Klebsiella sp. TSH15，关键方法为 16S rRNA 筛选和鉴定，主要结果为氨氮和硝酸盐氮去除率分别为 2.99 mg/L/h 和 2.53 mg/L/h。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2023.123299","t":"Porous TiWO3/SrWO4 with high titanium molar ratio for efficient photoelectrocatalytic nitrogen reduction under mild conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2023.123299","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environmental","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Kaiyi Chen","Xiaohong Xu","Qiong Mei","Jingwei Huang","Guidong Yang","Qizhao Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"具有高钛摩尔比的孔状 TiWO3/SrWO4 用于温和条件下高效的光电催化氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2023.123266","t":"Photocatalytic ammonia synthesis from nitrate reduction on nickel single-atom decorated on defective tungsten oxide","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2023.123266","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environmental","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yunlong Wang","Haibo Yin","Xiaoguang Zhao","Yakun Qu","Aiguo Zheng","Han Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在缺陷氧化钨上装饰的镍单原子用于硝酸盐还原的光催化氨合成","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcata.2024.119562","t":"Ionic-liquid-induced phthalocyanine monolayer electrocatalyst for efficient nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcata.2024.119562","s":"Applied Catalysis A: General","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ge Li","Chunxiao Jin","Baodong Wang","Ziran Ma","Pan Gao","Shuwei Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"离子液体诱导的酞菁单层电催化剂用于高效氮还原反应","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2023.03.322","t":"Increasing the catalytic efficiency of rhodium(0) nanoparticles in hydrolytic dehydrogenation of ammonia borane","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2023.03.322","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Saim Özkar"],"o":"回填","zt":"提高钌(0)纳米粒子在水解氨硼烷中的催化效率","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.gee.2022.06.007","t":"Integration of morphology and electronic structure modulation on cobalt phosphide nanosheets to boost photocatalytic hydrogen evolution from ammonia borane hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.gee.2022.06.007","s":"Green Energy & Environment","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The controllable and safe hydrogen storage technologies are widely recognized as the main bottleneck for the accomplishment of sustainable hydrogen energy. Ammonia borane (AB) has regarded as a competitive candidate for chemical hydrogen storage. However, developing efficient yet high-performance catalysts towards hydrogen evolution from AB hydrolysis remains an enormous challenge. Herein, cobalt phosphide nanosheets are synthesized by a facile salt-assisted along with low-temperature phosphidation strategy for simultaneously modulating its morphology and electronic structure, and function as hydrogen evolution photocatalysts. Impressively, the Co2P nanosheets display extraordinary performance with a record high turnover frequency of 44.9 min−1, outperforming most of the noble-metal-free catalysts reported to date. This remarkable performance is attributed to its desired nanosheets struc","au":["Chao Wan","Yu Liang","Liu Zhou","Jindou Huang","Jiapei Wang","Fengqiu Chen"],"o":"回填","zt":"在钴磷化物纳米片上结合形貌和电子结构调控以增强从氨硼烷水解中光催化制氢","zb":"钴磷化物纳米片通过简便的盐辅助低温磷化策略合成，用于同时调控其形貌和电子结构，作为制氢光催化剂。Co2P纳米片表现出优异性能，具有创纪录的44.9 min−1的周转频率，优于迄今为止报道的大多数无贵金属催化剂。这一性能归因于其理想的纳米片结构，具有高比表面积、丰富的暴露活性位点和短电荷扩散路径。","ob":"氨硼烷水解｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2023.130167","t":"Study on the influence factors of Pt-based catalyst on dehydrogen performance of ammonia borane hydrolysis-Which is more important, geometric effects or electronic effects?","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2023.130167","s":"Fuel","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jianxiu Wang","Mengmeng Tian","Haoliang Ma","Xiaofei Yu","Lanlan Li","Xinghua Zhang"],"o":"回填","zt":"关于 Pt 基催化剂对氨硼烷水解脱氢性能影响因素的研究-几何效应或电子效应哪个更重要？","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.eti.2024.103528","t":"Effect of terminal temperature on the morphology and heavy metal concentrations of typical rural domestic biochar and its potential use in ammonia nitrogen adsorption","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eti.2024.103528","s":"Environmental Technology & Innovation","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"In this study, straw, kitchen waste and pine needles were used as raw materials to prepare biochar at terminal temperatures of 300, 500 and 700 °C (SB, KB and PB), respectively. The morphology and concentrations of heavy metals extracted from biochar at different synthetic temperatures were analyzed by BCR (European Community Bureau of Reference) method. The effects of temperature and pH on the adsorption of ammonia nitrogen (NH4-N) in landfill leachate with SB, KB and PB were studied. The results show that the yield of PB300 was the highest (86.47%). Further analysis presents that SB, KB and PB contain basic functional groups (pH > 8.50) and the heavy metal content of SB, KB and PB is low (<2.564 mg∙kg-1). Moreover, it is found that terminal temperature is negatively correlated with heavy metal concentration. The F3 and F4 are the primary states of zinc (Zn), lead (Pb) and barium (Ba) o","au":["Shuangchao Wang","Xiaohan Xia","Chengzhen Du","Xuan Zhang","Qiao Xiang","Shuyan Guo"],"o":"回填","zt":"末端温度对典型农村家庭生物炭形态和重金属浓度的效应及其在氨氮吸附中的潜在应用","zb":"该研究使用秸秆、厨房垃圾和松针在 300、500 和 700 °C 下制备生物炭（SB、KB 和 PB）。通过 BCR 方法分析不同合成温度下生物炭的形态和重金属浓度。结果表明，PB300 产率最高（86.47%）。SB、KB 和 PB 含有碱性官能团（pH > 8.50）且重金属含量低（<2.564 mg∙kg-1）。末端温度与重金属浓度呈负相关。Zn、Pb 和 Ba 在 SB、KB 和 PB 中的主要存在状态为 F3 和 F4，表明产品具有较高的生物稳定性。潜在生态风险（RI）值低于 1，说明 SB、KB 和 PB 为非危险废物。在碱性 pH（pH = 9）下，SB500 在垃圾渗滤液中对 NH4-N 的吸附能力最佳（19.14 mg∙g-1），在 35 °C 下进一步提高吸附性能（21.88 mg∙g-1）","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.eti.2023.103465","t":"One-step green construction of granular composite hydrogels for ammonia nitrogen recovery from wastewater for crop growth promotion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eti.2023.103465","s":"Environmental Technology & Innovation","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The great application potential of hydrogel adsorbent in water treatment has been widely reported in recent years. However, practical application is severely restricted due to the tedious preparation procedures, high energy consumption, and potential environmental threat of spent adsorbent after adsorption. To address these challenges, a new method was proposed in this study to prepare granular hydrogel composites through one-step polymerization induced phase separation (PIPS), initiated via a redox reaction consisting with calcined oil shale semi-coke (COSSC) and active ingredients of in green tea (GT) at 40 oC. Then the granular hydrogel was applied to remove NH4-N in wastewater, and the spent adsorbent after adsorbing was used as the medium for plant growth. The granular hydrogel exhibited a favorable swelling capacity of 205 g/g and excellent adsorption capacity of 40.2 mg/g for NH4-","au":["Yan Liu","Yongfeng Zhu","Bin Mu","Li Zong","Xicun Wang","Aiqin Wang"],"o":"回填","zt":"一步绿色构建颗粒状复合水凝胶用于从废水中回收氨氮促进作物生长","zb":"该研究提出通过一步聚合诱导相分离（PIPS）制备颗粒状复合水凝胶，以解决传统水凝胶制备繁琐、能耗高和废弃吸附剂潜在环境威胁的问题。该方法使用热解油页岩半焦（COSSC）和绿茶活性成分在 40°C 下引发反应。所得颗粒状水凝胶对 NH4-N 具有良好的溶胀能力（205 g/g）和吸附能力（40.2 mg/g），吸附平衡时间仅 30 分钟。无土栽培实验表明，添加 1% 废弃水凝胶使绿豆总生物量增加 33.69%","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.desal.2023.117099","t":"Enhanced ammonia recovery from strong ammonia wastewater via a transmembrane electro-chemisorption system with authigenic acid and base","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.desal.2023.117099","s":"Desalination","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Zhiqiang Zhang","Ruifeng Deng","Jiao Zhang","Lu She","Guangfeng Wei","Renyong Jia"],"o":"回填","zt":"通过具有原生成酸和碱的跨膜电化学吸附系统从强氨废水增强氨回收","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2024.148733","t":"Nb1-Zr dual active sites constructed on ZrO2 boost nitrite-to-ammonia electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2024.148733","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2024-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Wenyu Du","Zeyi Sun","Kai Chen","Fuzhou Wang","Ke Chu"],"o":"回填","zt":"在ZrO2上构建的Nb1-Zr双活性位点促进亚硝酸盐至氨的电还原","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1}]);
